<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="REV" style="id">- Kuloonaay</book>
  <para style="h">Káyisan</para>
  <para style="toc2">Káyisan</para>
  <para style="toc1">Káyisan ka</para>
  <para style="mt1">Káyisan ka</para>
  <para style="imt">Waah wa weeyem wa ti púkoo eyye</para>
  <para style="rem">Note: the first and last paragraphs of this intro, in italics, are for the audio recording only.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="it">Aluu pakanam keeyemaam ka ti káasiitan, inci kicanaa.</char>
  </para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="ip">Cóopiyoo unaa púkoo ya eti Káyisan ka, íllafi upusincanaa ayme akiice púkoo eyye, teyme naakiice yo niŋ peyme naakiice yo. Púkoo eyye <char style="w">Saŋ</char> akiice yo. Eehe nkasoke nii pikee pa, Saŋ aŋuu lompo akiice púkoo ya eti ekooŋan ya éesuume ya eti Saŋ niŋ lompo sileetal sa síhaaciil sa siti Saŋ. Akiicaakiic púkoo eyye ti pikelan eloŋ ya eteyoo, oom waati akina ti ékuluma ti econ eyya nkasok ya Patumos, ti caanak enca ammeya nii kéeyinane ka ti Yéesu unka ti kaakallanee meemak kamma káyinan ka kiteyii.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ti pakayme naakiice púkoo eyye? Akiicaakiic yo ti sicanku siyema isak niŋ súsupak ti mah ma miti Asii. Pakakee ti kéeyinane ka ti picanku empuu, nkacuk kúnuul kamma kaakallanee enkuu. Pakakee kéeyinane ka, pikalaŋana keeneetaat pánipani nkayeno hiŋes kaalincanii. Pakakee paka nkayeno émakiyanoolo apan káhinut waah ti kámakiyan Pútuun pa. Yéesu náatunk Saŋ apikiic púkoo eyye, kati apenan kéeyinane ka sempe niŋ páhaañi kapucok kíp ti káyinan ka kiteyii.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ti púkoo eyye, hícump waah úciiticiiti káacenkin niŋ káawincinool, hícump kéeyinane ti Yéesu kásiyoolut ti pácenkinal eteyyo, pale hoonool hiyem le heehiina hat hikina hiyem, Pútuun pa amansa ti coonool niŋ Añii etempo Yéesu Krista, mpíyemi ti <char style="w">elemeyu</char> etempo, pikina pikaakaay iheeku akamool etempo, <char style="w">Seetaani</char> ya, mpupuuñanool pakan etempo keecoke ka kíp ti káyinan ka kiteyii.</para>
  <para style="ip">Saŋ náayisan nii, Pútuun pa píñikenaañiken meemak ti pakanc pa piti pakan paka. Mpíyisan káñiken enkuu pínapii ti hícump hítaapanu samat nii, épankul, páyiyiŋanal etaam, hikam, úkuuñu niŋ seemak. Píhinaahin eehuu ancuk pakan paka káwunkiyaa umuuyen wa uteyii nkámakiyan po.</para>
  <para style="ip">Púkoo eyye náayisan lompo hikam heeyem ti pitaako ti pututa Pútuun pa niŋ Seetaani ya. Seetaani ya, eeyem ya lompo nínkinankoo ya, yoopiya ti páhin pínapii ti píhina eteyyo, poko kayem élukuleen elampa ya niŋ <char style="w">ayaamakoola</char> ya eeneetaat a pánipani. Néhin lompo pínapii ti akee aal ahaañiya enfakat. Ti payenkuu Seetaani ya nénapii epilincan pakan paka, néekatinool pakan paka niŋ Pútuun pa, neenaŋii kaakallanee kenfakat. Pale Pútuun pa piheekaaheek hikam eehe pínapii ti Añii etempo Yéesu Krista, Císaacii ca citi Pútuun pa ceetaaŋee ca, ceenoome ca Pútuun pa pakan paka ti hísim etenco.</para>
  <para style="ip">Saŋ náayisan lompo nii, keecoke ka kíp ti káyinan ka kiteyii ti Císaacii ca niŋ ti tooñaa ya eyya nkátuunane ya, apan kawufanut eloŋii ti kincaam ka kiti Seetaani ya, Pútuun pa efipupuuñanoolii. Mpuwufanii eloŋ ya eepayantoo ya eekaakaay ya pitaako ti patiila éeyeeni ya niŋ ti etaam ya éeyeeni ya.</para>
  <para style="is">Kikee kilim keetaake nafaa</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="k">Elemeyu </char> - ekina eyem híkon hiti amansa.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="k">Cáwii</char> - ekina eyem la amansa naayem ati hikaw, samat nii cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa, cikina ciyem pakan paka púlooŋ keesayane ka Pútuun pa nii pikina piyem amansa ya ateyii.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="k">Púlunta</char> - ekina eyem dúniyaa ya.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="k">Ayaamakoola</char> - akina ayem an aŋa nákup ti caacaw ca citi Pútuun pa. Ayaamakoola pánipani nasoksok eeha Pútuun pa mpusoke ha.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="k">Caminkoloŋ</char> - ekina eyem cuuraay.</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="it">Alaapalaka meemak ti káasiitan ka kiti aluu. Alímaati Pútuun pa pípankin kunuu unaa, mpípankin saan unaa pipiyankanan unaa kati úyiniyaa kasayan hilim etempo. Amíini. </char>
  </para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="REV 1" />
  <para style="s">Kaacempes heekiicee ha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 1:1" />Púkoo eyye eyekane waah wa weeyolee wa ewwa Yéesu Krista náayisane wa. Pútuun pa puwufanoo wo ancuk áyisanaa wo pimiikan etempo, kati kámeyi heekaakaay ha pitaako toko fiye. Yéesu Krista náapoñii <char style="w">maleekoo</char> ya eteyoo épikey esok <char style="w">Saŋ</char> amiikan a ateyoo. <verse eid="REV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 1:2" />Saŋ naakaman eeha púlooŋ naacuke ha: Eehe hiyem hilim ha héefulii ha pati Pútuun pa, niŋ tooñaa ya eyya Yéesu Krista naasokoo ya. <verse eid="REV 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 1:3" />Aŋe púkoo eti kaayaamakool kiti heekaakaay ha pitaako. Ayihaayih eekaakaay ya kalaŋ eteyyo hátikin canku ya, kayihaayih kéesiitane ho ka nkátuul heekiicee ha ti púkoo eyye, kaatuko caanak ca cílohaniyoo ta eehe púlooŋ efihitaako ta.<verse eid="REV 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kakican sicanku isak niŋ súsupak sa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 1:4" />Inci <char style="w">Saŋ</char>, yem aluu ti hikiicu, aluu kéeyinane ka keeyem ka ti sicanku sa isak niŋ súsupak sa seeyem sa ti mah ma miti Asii: Alímaati Pútuun pa pisampan aluu mpuwufan aluu kásuumaay, pikina peeyem pa, niŋ peetaakiye pa hínum, niŋ peeyem pa ti ékey. Alímaati <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> isak niŋ kúsupak ka keeyem ka hátikin <char style="w">elemeyu</char> ya, kisampan aluu nkuwufan aluu kásuumaay. <verse eid="REV 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 1:5" />Alímaati Yéesu Krista, eehintiyee ya ti eeha nasok ha, asampan aluu naawufan aluu kásuumaay. Akina áyaañe álitoonii ti eket ya, náayemi lompo ati hikaw ha ati pumansa pa púlooŋ pakati <char style="w">púlunta pa</char>.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:5">Náalafi unaa, naafakan unaa ti umuuyen wa utuunaa pínapii ti hísim ha hiteyoo. <verse eid="REV 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 1:6" />Náahin unaa upuyeniyaa pakati cáwii, niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">puwaaseena pakati Pútuun pa</char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:6">Efúlii 19:6</ref></char></note> Paapaa ateyoo. Alímaati hamake ha niŋ sempe sa kayeno pakateyoo fo cancowiyaaw púley! Amíini. <verse eid="REV 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 1:7" />Nisincan, Yéesu oopa ti ékey niŋ útiŋu wa<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dañel 7:13</ref></char></note> apan an óo an afaacukoo, háati keeyayoo ka,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 12:10">Sakaliya 12:10</ref></char></note> písii pa púlooŋ piti púlunta pa efipiyeno ti esampoolo kamma akina. Fo efihitaako! Amíini.<verse eid="REV 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 1:8" />
    <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> Pútuun pa mpusok: “Inci yem Ayáañ a niŋ Akelan a, Alfa ya niŋ Omega ya,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ti kaŋ ya eti Kilek, ti alfapet ya, leetal ya éyaañ ya eyem alfa, leetal ya ekelan ya eyem omega. Ta Yéesu naasoke ta nii: “Inci yem Alfa ya niŋ Omega ya”, ekina eyem: “Inci yem Ayáañ a niŋ Akelan a.”</char></note> eeyem ya niŋ eetaakiye ya hínum, niŋ eeyem a ti ékey, ati sempe sa púlooŋ.”<verse eid="REV 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Saŋ hicuku ha hiteyoo Eenucee ya ati Pútuun pa pucuk fiye nii éyawut</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 1:9" />Inci <char style="w">Saŋ</char>, an aluu ti káyinan, kamma inci iyyem anapana ati Yéesu, inci áwii aluu ti kamukut ka kiti kúnuul ka enka nkitaako ka ti keeyem ka ti <char style="w" lemma="Cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa">cáwii</char> etempo. Kacoopaamcoop ti econ eyya nkasok ya Patumos kamma inci íntuunane <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char> niŋ tooñaa eyya Yéesu náayisanaam ya. <verse eid="REV 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 1:10" />Ti Hinoom ha hiti <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char>, <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> nkúwanoonii ti inci, fiye ínsi pusonam hilim heeceeke samat nii kámpiis. <verse eid="REV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 1:11" />Nihisok: “Kiic ti kaahit aŋa ankaakaay ya hicuku, impoñ ko ti sicanku sa isak niŋ súsupak sa seeyem sa ti pisaatee empe: Efes, Sumilin, Pelukam, Tiyatil, Saatis, Filatelufi niŋ Lawotise.”<verse eid="REV 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 1:12" />Iyyeso kati cuk eeyem a ti káakup niŋ inci. Ta inci iyyesiye ta incuk písiiŋanuma lampi piti sanoo piyema isak niŋ súsupak. <verse eid="REV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 1:13" />Ti pututa písiiŋanuma lampi pa intaak an eecuke nii <char style="w">Añii An</char>, náasoolo hísool heehaane heewaniye fo ti wootoo niŋ kaafaal keecuke nii sanoo keeposoole púsusoo. <verse eid="REV 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 1:14" />Wan wa uti hikawoo núuhiini hat nii épin, ñíkinoo iññicuk nii kaaleew seemak. <verse eid="REV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 1:15" />Wootoo nuumiñal nii mañ meesafee, hilimoo nihicuk nii kúsuu kenfakat kiti kaatii.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:9">Dañel 7:9</ref>,<ref loc="DAN 7:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 10:5-6">10:5-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 1:16" />Naacok ti epeesoo yáali sicaaŋaŋ isak niŋ súsupak, epaay eeliye ti upii úsupak néefulii ti putumoo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 49:2">Esayi 49:2</ref></char></note> Puhooŋuyoo mpimiñal samat nii caanak ceeyem ti hikaw.<verse eid="REV 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 1:17" />Ta inci incukoo ta, innow ti wootoo pucuk fiye nii an eekete. Pale naanaŋ epeesoo yáali ti inci naasok: “Timpi fe! Inci yem Ayáañ a niŋ Akelan a.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 44:6">Esayi 44:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 48:12">48:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 1:18" />Inci lompo yem eeyem a Kaloŋa; inci ketaaket, pale fiye sincan, inci oopa kaloŋa fo cancowiyaaw púley! Iyyekan púkululuma pa piti eket ya niŋ piti cáwii ca citi keekete ka. <verse eid="REV 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 1:19" />Fiye, kiic eeha ancuke ha, heeyem ha ti pitaako fiye niŋ heekaakaay ha pitaako hátikin. <verse eid="REV 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 1:20" />Sicaaŋaŋ sa isak niŋ súsupak sa ensa ancuke sa ti epeesam yáali, niŋ písiiŋanuma lampi pa piti sanoo ya isak niŋ súsupak sa siyem eehe: Sicaaŋaŋ sa isak niŋ súsupak sa siyem <char style="w" lemma="Maleekoo">pumaleekoo</char> pa piti sicanku sa isak niŋ súsupak sa, písiiŋanuma lampi pa isak niŋ súsupak sa siyem sicanku sa isak niŋ súsupak sa.”<verse eid="REV 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="REV 2" />
  <para style="s">Ekooŋan ya eti canku ya eti Efes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 2:1" />
    <char style="w">Añii An</char> nene asokam: “Kiic eehe impoñ ho ti <char style="w">maleekoo</char> ya eti canku ya eti saatee ya eti Efes: 'Ehe ekooŋan ya éefulii ya ti eecoke ya sicaaŋaŋ sa isak niŋ súsupak sa ti epeesoo yáali, apan namuusool ti pututa písiiŋanuma lampi piti sanoo piyema isak niŋ súsupak sa. <verse eid="REV 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 2:2" />Inci méyimeyi páhinal pa piti aluu, páhin pa piti aluu penfakat pa niŋ kamukut ka kiti aluu. Inci méyimeyi nii niyinaat kasayan pakan keenaput, innicakanool-cakanool meemak innitah kunuu ti keecokooliye ka nii poko <char style="w" lemma="Apoñapoñ">pupoñapoñ</char> pale kaneetaat fo, innicuk nii poko ñincaama. <verse eid="REV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 2:3" />Inci méyimeyi lompo nii nimukutaamukut meemak, innicuk kúnuul kamma caacawam apan niñohiit puson ti káwusen. <verse eid="REV 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 2:4" />Pale eehe hísuumutam ti aluu: nílafiitam samat nii púcook pa, nílafooliit lompo samat nii púcook pa. <verse eid="REV 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 2:5" />Ooto pusok aluu, nínawuno fa ínnilafiyaam fa hínum niŋ fa ínnilafooli fa, éfinipannum nii nitaakut fiye pálafi samat nii púcook pa. Niŋ níwunkiit umuuyen wa uti aluu, inci fákey ínfulan ésiiŋanuma lampi ya eti aluu la neyeno la. <verse eid="REV 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 2:6" />Pale eehe hísuumaam ti aluu: ninataanat heenaput eeha pinapana pa pakati Nikolas nkáhin ha samat nii fa inci lompo innate fa. <verse eid="REV 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 2:7" />An óo an eetaake kaanuu, ásiitan eeha <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> nkusoke ha picanku pa. An óo an eeheeke, inci fakatoo apili ti enuun ya eti eloŋ ya,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:8-9">Púcook 2:8-9</ref></char></note> eeyem ya ti alacana ya eti Pútuun pa.'”<verse eid="REV 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ekooŋan ya eti canku ya eti Sumilin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 2:8" />
    <char style="w">Añii An</char> nene asokam: “Kiic eehe impoñ ho ti <char style="w">maleekoo</char> ya eti canku ya eti saatee ya eti Sumilin: 'Ehe ekooŋan ya éefulii ya ti Ayáañ a niŋ Akelan a, eekete ya apan náalitaniyee ti eket ya. <verse eid="REV 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 2:9" />Inci méyimeyi kúnuul ka kiti aluu niŋ palek pa piti aluu, pale aluu kusaanum! Inci méyimeyi heenaput eeha nkasok ha kiti aluu. Payenkuu kasok poko <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pale tooñaa tom, poko kayoŋ kiti <char style="w">Seetaani</char> ya. <verse eid="REV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 2:10" />Timpi nife kúnuul enka innikaakaay ka hicuku. Nísiitan, Seetaani ya efeewant pakakee ti aluu ti núkuluma nipiwinkiyee, apan efinicuk kúnuul fo kunoom ŋaasuwan. Nicok kíp ti inci, háati ti putum eket, inci fawufan aluu eloŋ ya eepayantoo ya samat nii panteeloo eti kayine. <verse eid="REV 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 2:11" />An óo an eetaake kaanuu, ásiitan eeha <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> nkusoke ha picanku pa. An óo an eeheeke, eket ya ésupiyenu ya ételikoo.'”<verse eid="REV 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ekooŋan ya eti canku ya eti Pelukam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 2:12" />
    <char style="w">Añii An</char> nene asokam: “Kiic eehe impoñ ho ti <char style="w">maleekoo</char> ya eti canku ya eti saatee ya eti Pelukam: 'Ehe ekooŋan ya éefulii ya ti eetaake ya epaay ya eeliye ya ti upii úsupak. <verse eid="REV 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 2:13" />Inci méyimeyi pa innikine pa, toko <char style="w">elemeyu</char> ya eti <char style="w">Seetaani</char> ya neeyem. Pale innicok kíp ti caacawam. Nílaacinut káyinan ka kiti aluu ti inci, háati ti kunoom ka kiti Antipas, eehintiyee ya ti eeha nasok ha kutoom, eemukee ya ti saatee ya eti aluu la Seetaani ya neekine la.<verse eid="REV 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 2:14" />“'Pale eehe hísuumutam ti aluu: Pakakee unka ti aluu keecoke pakalaŋanal pa piti Palaam. Akina akalaŋane Palak fa áfaaluuŋ pakati <char style="w">Israyel</char> ti kaamuuyen ancuk kati kali paliyal pa peewaaseenee pa ti pínaati, nkahinto niŋ pakaal keeneetaat pakaalii.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 25:1-2">Pafinal 25:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 31:16">31:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 2:15" />Fo lompo incuke, innitaak pakakee ti aluu keecoke pakalaŋanal pa piti Nikolas. <verse eid="REV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 2:16" />Ooto níwunko umuuyen wa uti aluu! Niŋ fotom, inci fákey ti aluu toko fiye íntaakoolanii niŋ epaay ya eti putumam.<verse eid="REV 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 2:17" />“'An óo an eetaake kaanuu, ásiitan eeha <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> nkusoke ha picanku pa. An óo an eeheeke, inci fawufanoo ti paliyal empa nkasok pa <char style="w">manna</char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:14-15">Efúlii 16:14-15</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 16:31">31</ref></char></note> peeyolee pa. Inci fawufan lompo oom an énankiin eehiina eti caacaw céeyeeni<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 62:2">Esayi 62:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 65:15">65:15</ref></char></note> ceekiicee teyyo, enca ammeya nii eesaye yo ya lamma áfaameyi co.'”<verse eid="REV 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ekooŋan ya eti canku ya eti Tiyatil</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 2:18" />
    <char style="w">Añii An</char> nene asokam: “Kiic eehe impoñ ho ti <char style="w">maleekoo</char> ya eti canku ya eti saatee ya eti Tiyatil: 'Ehe ekooŋan ya éefulii ya ti Añii ya ati Pútuun pa, aŋa ñíkinoo ñeecuke ña samat nii kaaleew seemak, wootoo nuumiñal samat nii mañ meesafee. <verse eid="REV 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 2:19" />Inci méyimeyi páhinal pa piti aluu, pálafi pa piti aluu niŋ káyinan ka kiti aluu, kamukut ka kiti aluu niŋ fa inniyankanan fa pakakee paka. Aluu unka ti íhinu fiye pihaŋ eeha ínnihin ha ti púcook pa. <verse eid="REV 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 2:20" />Pale eehe hísuumutam ti aluu: aal a aŋa nkasok a Yesepel,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:31">1 Pumansa 16:31</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 19:1-2">19:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 9:22">2 Pumansa 9:22</ref>,<ref loc="2KI 9:30-33">30-33</ref></char></note> eecokooliye ya nii akina <char style="w">ayaamakoola</char>, nikatanookatan apilincan pimiikan pa pakatoom. Ti pakalaŋanaloo nalincanii. Tempo wune nkahinto niŋ pakaal keeneetaat pakaalii, nkali paliyal pa peewaaseenee pa ti pínaati. <verse eid="REV 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 2:21" />Inci ufanoowufan waati kati áwunko umuuyen wa uteyoo, pale naapook kakatan pahaaño pa piteyoo niŋ pákayiin. <verse eid="REV 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 2:22" />Nisincan, inci fatahoo káakuuñu enka efikihintanoo, ínhin payenka nkahinto ka neyoo kapucuk kúnuul kenfakat, fo niŋ káwunkiyaa páhinal pa piteyoo peenaput pa. <verse eid="REV 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 2:23" />Famuk pinapana pa pakateyoo. Fiyuu picanku pa púlooŋ éfipimeyi nii inci yem aŋa námeyi ya heeyem ha ti yaan niŋ kunuu an,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 7:9">Kícimu 7:9</ref></char></note> apan facooy an óo an ti páhinaloo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 62:12">Kícimu 62:12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:10">Jeremiya 17:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 2:24" />“'Pale inci taakaataak lompo ekooŋan eti aluu púlooŋ pakati Tiyatil, keecokut ka pakalaŋanal pa piteyoo apan nísuuniit meemak ti eeha nkasok ha 'héesuna ha heeyolee ha hiti <char style="w">Seetaani</char> ya'. Inci etinene tiyan aluu pikee pitiyo, <verse eid="REV 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 2:25" />fo inneetaat hisoku, nicok kíp ti eeha innitaake ha fo ta inci fákey. <verse eid="REV 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 2:26" />An óo an eeheeke, naaloŋ ti íhinu eeha inci íllafiye ha fo ti pikelan, fawufanoo sempe ti <char style="w">púlunta pa</char> púlooŋ. <verse eid="REV 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 2:27" />Afaayeno ati hikaw ha ateyii, náatintiŋanii niŋ hikasap hiti mañ, naahumaloolii nii púlumpa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:8-9">Kícimu 2:8-9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="REV 2:28" />Afaataak sempe sa soonool sa ensa inci insaye sa púfulii ti Paapaa atoom, uwwufanoo lompo ecaaŋaŋ ya eti pucom pa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 24:17">Pafinal 24:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="REV 2:29" />An óo an eetaake kaanuu, ásiitan eeha <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> nkusoke ha picanku pa.'”<verse eid="REV 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="REV 3" />
  <para style="s">Ekooŋan ya eti canku ya eti Saatis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 3:1" />
    <char style="w">Añii An</char> nene asokam: “Kiic eehe impoñ ho ti <char style="w">maleekoo</char> ya eti canku ya eti saatee ya eti Saatis: 'Ehe ekooŋan ya éefulii ya ti eecoke ya Kunuu ka isak niŋ kúsupak ka kiti Pútuun pa niŋ sicaaŋaŋ isak niŋ súsupak sa. Inci méyimeyi páhinal pa piti aluu, nicokeecok nii keeyem kaloŋa pale aluu keekete. <verse eid="REV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 3:2" />Nilito! Káyinan ka kiti aluu unka ti eket, níhin kata kipitaak sempe, kaatuko inci cukaacuk nii páhinal aluu pútuuniit hátikin Pútuun pa putoom. <verse eid="REV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 3:3" />Ooto nínawuno eeha ínnisiye ha, ínninawuno lompo eeha innisayane ha. Nicok ho kíp, ínniwunko umuuyen wa uti aluu. Pale niŋ nilitiit, inci fákey ti aluu samat nii álipa, apan étinimeyi teyme inci inkaakaay ékey ti aluu.<verse eid="REV 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 3:4" />“'Háati fo, taakaataak pakakee ti canku ya eti Saatis keelecatanut wañ wa uteyii. Poko efikanapool niŋ inci niŋ wañ weehiina, kaatuko kéetuuniye. <verse eid="REV 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 3:5" />An óo an eeheeke, áfaasoolee lompo wañ weehiina. Inci etitoot oom an caacawoo ti púkoo ya eti eloŋ ya, pale éfituunan caacaw encuu hátikin Paapaa atoom niŋ pumaleekoo pa piteyoo. <verse eid="REV 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 3:6" />An óo an eetaake kaanuu, ásiitan eeha <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> nkusoke ha picanku pa.'”<verse eid="REV 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ekooŋan ya eti canku ya eti Filatelufi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 3:7" />
    <char style="w">Añii An</char> nene asokam: “Kiic eehe impoñ ho ti <char style="w">maleekoo</char> ya eti canku ya eti saatee ya eti Filatelufi: 'Ehe ekooŋan ya éefulii ya ti an a eekuule ya náayemi ati páni, eeyekane ya ékululuma ya eti amansa ya <char style="w">Dawid</char>. Niŋ ápankinaa hunkut, an ayinaat ho hipanku, niŋ apankaa lompo hunkut, an ayinaat ho káapankin.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 22:22">Esayi 22:22</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 3:8" />“'Inci méyimeyi páhinal pa piti aluu. Nisincan, inci oopa siiŋane hátikini hunkut héepankinee eeha an naayinaat hipanku. Inci méyimeyi nii nitaakut sempe; háati fo, ínnituul hilim ha hitoom apan nílaacinut caacawam. <verse eid="REV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 3:9" />Nisincan, taakaataak pakan keeyem ti saatee ya eti aluu pakati kayoŋ ka kiti <char style="w">Seetaani</char> ya, keecoke faŋii nii <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> apan Pusuwif tom, pale ñincaama. Inci fáhinii kápikey nkákilipo ti woot aluu kati kámeyi nii inci láfilafi aluu. <verse eid="REV 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 3:10" />Inci sokaasok aluu nimukut apan ínnituul hilim ha hitoom, ooto inci lompo famank aluu ti caanak ca citi páciite pa ceeyem ca ti ékey ti <char style="w">púlunta pa</char> púlooŋ, kati winko keekine ka ti etaam ya. <verse eid="REV 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 3:11" />Inci oopa ti ékey toko fiye. Nicok kíp ti eeha innitaake ha, ancuk an timpi acoop panteeloo ya eti kayine ka ti aluu. <verse eid="REV 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 3:12" />An óo an eeheeke inci fáhinoo apiyeno esafu ti <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char> putoom. Apan atanene áful teyyo. Inci fakiic teyoo caacaw ca citi Pútuun pa putoom niŋ caacaw ca citi saatee ya eti Pútuun pa putoom, eeyem ya <char style="w">Jerusalem</char> éeyeeni ya, néeyemi ti éwanoonii púfulii alacana pati Pútuun pa putoom. Inci fakiic lompo teyii caacawam céeyeeni ca.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 62:2">Esayi 62:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 3:13" />An óo an eetaake kaanuu, ásiitan eeha <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> nkusoke ha picanku pa.'”<verse eid="REV 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ekooŋan ya eti canku ya eti Lawotise</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 3:14" />
    <char style="w">Añii An</char> nene asokam: “Kiic eehe impoñ ho ti <char style="w">maleekoo</char> ya eti canku ya eti saatee ya eti Lawotise: 'Ehe ekooŋan ya éefulii ya ti an a eeyem a Amíini, eehintiyee ya ti eeha nasok ha, náayemi ati páni, áyaañ a ti paliilal pa piti Pútuun pa.<verse eid="REV 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 3:15" />“'Inci méyimeyi páhinal pa piti aluu, ímmeyi nii eloŋ ya eti aluu emonut, esowaat lompo. Illáfi epimon niŋ fotom néesowi! <verse eid="REV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 3:16" />Pale kamma neeyem ti pututa: esowaat emonut lompo, inci fáfaacii aluu ti putumam. <verse eid="REV 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 3:17" />Kaatuko nisok: "Unii kusaanum, utaakaataak waah óo waah ewwa nuusoolahe apan usoolahut háati waah." Pale nípannumut nii aluu likee tom, ínniketanani ti hikaw, innilek, ínnifuum ínniyemi ñáfalfali. <verse eid="REV 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 3:18" />Fiye inci puwun aluu kunuu, níkey ninoom ti inci sanoo eti pánipani, mantefa ínniyenoonii kusaanum. Ninoom lompo wañ weehiina kati nísoolo, ancuk níwufaloolaa ñáfalfali ña ñiti aluu ñeesuuwanana ña. Inninoom lompo hipuun nipisotan ti ñíkin aluu kati níyini hicuku. <verse eid="REV 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 3:19" />Inci ínkulkul incoonanool payenka púlooŋ íllafiye ka.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:12">Kusoku 3:12</ref></char></note> Ooto nihiliikan nípiwunko umuuyen wa uti aluu. <verse eid="REV 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 3:20" />Nisincan! Inci oopa siiŋiye ti hunkut ha iwwenken. Niŋ akee ti aluu ásiyaa hilimam náapankin hunkut ha, inci fanako illi niŋ oom an nantoonool. <verse eid="REV 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 3:21" />An óo an eeheeke, afaayeno look niŋ inci ti <char style="w">elemeyu</char> ya etoom, samat nii fa inci inheeke fa iyyeno niŋ Paapaa atoom ti elemeyu ya eteyoo. <verse eid="REV 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 3:22" />An óo an eetaake kaanuu, ásiitan eeha <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> nkusoke ha picanku pa.'”<verse eid="REV 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="REV 4" />
  <para style="s">Elemeyu ya eti alacana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 4:1" />Eehuu hipimuus, ínhaafin incuk hunkut héepankinee alacana. Hilim eeha inci ínsiye ha ti púcook, níhikup niŋ inci samat nii kámpiis. Nihisok: “Síloonii pe, inci fáyisani eeha efihitaako ha po hátikin.” <verse eid="REV 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 4:2" />Tokotoko <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> nkúwanoonii ti inci, incuk hátikinam <char style="w">elemeyu</char> alacana, akee naayeno teyyo. <verse eid="REV 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 4:3" />Eeyeniye ya ti elemeyu ya naamiñal tas samat nii pínankiin pa péeciita pa hinoom empa nkasok pa casup niŋ salutin. Etíifeel eemiñale tas neeposool elemeyu ya.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:26-28">Esekiyel 1:26-28</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 10:1">10:1</ref></char></note> Pacuk étiifeel ya mpucuk nii énankiin ya éeciita ya hinoom eyya nkasok ya emelot. <verse eid="REV 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 4:4" />Sikee silemeyu siyema áwii niŋ sipaakiil ínsikiipool elemeyu ya, ñíhampaatiin kayema áwii niŋ pakapaakiil nkayeno ti oom pilemeyu. Nkásoolo wañ weehiina nkáwuulo púwuulu amansa piti sanoo. <verse eid="REV 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 4:5" />Pamaliñoolal etiil mpúfulii ti elemeyu ya, niŋ lompo pahampanane niŋ pasapal etiil. Hátikin elemeyu ya intaak silampi isak niŋ súsupak seeyeniye híceeku. Ensuu siyem Kunuu ka keenape ka isak niŋ kúsupak ka kiti Pútuun pa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:16">Efúlii 19:16</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 1:13">Esekiyel 1:13</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 4:2">Sakaliya 4:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 4:6" />Hátikin elemeyu ya intaak lompo waah weecuke nii kaatii kiti weeloo eemiñale tas.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 4:6">Pukol elemeyu ya, intaak waah upaakiil weeyem kaloŋa wéekiipoole yo, nuumeeŋ ñíkin puson niŋ hátikin. <verse eid="REV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 4:7" />Waah wa úcook wa ti weeyem wa kaloŋa nuucuk nii cata, úsupiyenu wa nuucuk nii híciin, úhaaciyenu wa nuutaak puhooŋu piti an, úpaakiilenu wa nuucuk nii hisiwita heeyem ti káyitu.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:5-10">Esekiyel 1:5-10</ref>,<ref loc="EZK 1:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 10:14">10:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 4:8" />Waah wa upaakiil wa púlooŋ weeyem wa kaloŋa nuutaakal úpitu isak niŋ koonool, nuumeeŋ ñíkin lan óo lan, háati t’etaam úpitu etewwo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:18">Esekiyel 1:18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 10:12">10:12</ref> </char></note> Hánant hanakan úyekuniyantoo hisoku:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:8">“Peekuule, peekuule,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:8">
    <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> Pútuun pa piti sempe sa púlooŋ peekuule,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:2-3">Esayi 6:2-3</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:8">akina eetaakiye ya hínum, eeyem ya, niŋ eeyem a ti ékey.”<verse eid="REV 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 4:9" />Tan óo tan waah wa weeyem wa kaloŋa núumul, núumakiyan, nuusok apalaka eeyeniye ya ti elemeyu ya, eeyem a kaloŋa fo cancowiyaaw púley, <verse eid="REV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 4:10" />ñíhampaatiin ña áwii niŋ pakapaakiil paka nkákilipo hátikin eeyeniye ya ti elemeyu ya, nkámul eeyem a kaloŋa fo cancowiyaaw púley. Nkawaat púwuulu pa piteyii piti himansate ha nkanaŋ po hátikin elemeyu ya nkasok:<verse eid="REV 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 4:11" />“Ateeteyo Pútuun pa putoonii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">awe túuniye hisayu hamake niŋ sempe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">awe túuniye lompo kámakiyanee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:11">kaatuko awe liile waah wa púlooŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">apan ti pásuumayi nuuliilee nuutaako.”<verse eid="REV 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="REV 5" />
  <para style="s">Císaacii ca niŋ kaahit ka keepoonee ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 5:1" />Púful toko, incuk ti epees yáali ya eti eeyeniye ya ti <char style="w">elemeyu</char> ya kaahit keepoonee.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 2:9-10">Esekiyel 2:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 29:11">Esayi 29:11</ref></char></note> Kaahit enkuu nkitaak pakiical páhantuwa niŋ tíkitaaŋ etenko, nkipankee niŋ pasotal sontel piyema isak niŋ púsupak. <verse eid="REV 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 5:2" />Incuk lompo <char style="w">maleekoo</char> eti sempe ti káatuunan niŋ hilim heeceeke, neesok: “Ayme ayem éetuuniye kati áfulan pasotal sontel ya, náapankin kaahit ka?” <verse eid="REV 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 5:3" />Pale taakut an alacana, niŋ fotom t’etaam, niŋ fotom páhantuwa etaam ya, eeyina káapankin kaahit ka, naasincan páhantuwa etenko. <verse eid="REV 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 5:4" />Inkooŋ meemak kamma an naataakutee éetuuniye kati ápankin kaahit ka niŋ fotom naasincan páhantuwa etenko. <verse eid="REV 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 5:5" />Fiye akee ti ñíhampaatiin ña naasokam: “Timpi kooŋ! Sincan, Cata ya eti miin ma miti <char style="w">Juda</char>,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 49:9">Púcook 49:9</ref></char></note> Hínkonk ha hiti <char style="w">Dawid</char>,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:1">Esayi 11:1</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 11:10">10</ref></char></note> aheekaaheek. Ayíniyini káfulan pasotal sontel ya isak niŋ púsupak pa, náapankin kaahit ka.”<verse eid="REV 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 5:6" />Fiye incuk císaacii, ceecuke nii citaaŋeetaaŋ hínum,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:7">Esayi 53:7</ref></char></note> incisiiŋo ti pututa elemeyu ya niŋ waah wa upaakiil wa weeyem wa kaloŋa, ñíhampaatiin ña nkákiipool co. Císaacii ca incitaak usiin isak niŋ úsupak niŋ lompo ñíkin isak niŋ ñúsupak, ukina uyem <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> isak niŋ kúsupak ka kiti Pútuun pa keepoñee ka ti <char style="w">púlunta pa</char> púlooŋ.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 4:10">Sakaliya 4:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 5:7" />Císaacii ca incikaay incicoop kaahit ka ti epees yáali ya eti eeyeniye ya ti elemeyu ya. <verse eid="REV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 5:8" />Ta Císaacii ca incicoope ta kaahit ka, waah wa upaakiil wa weeyem wa kaloŋa niŋ ñíhampaatiin ña áwii niŋ pakapaakiil paka nkákilipo hátikin etenco. An óo an teyii naataak kóntiŋ nkayekanal pupool piti sanoo peemeeŋe caminkoloŋ, ekina eyem kaluum ka kiti <char style="w">keesampanee ka pakati Pútuun pa</char>. <verse eid="REV 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 5:9" />Nkacook hícimu héeyeeni,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 33:10">Kícimu 33:10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 98:1">98:1</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:10">Esayi 42:10</ref></char></note> nkasok:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">“Aátuunaatuuno aakati coop kaahit ka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">ínfulan pasotal etenko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">kamma antaaŋee;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">niŋ hísim ha hitii annoome Pútuun pa pakan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">kéefulii ti síi óo síi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">híleeluuf óo híleeluuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">pakan óo pakan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">niŋ mah óo mah.<verse eid="REV 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 5:10" />Aáhiniihin kapiyeno <char style="w" lemma="Cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa">cáwii</char> niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">puwaaseena pakati Pútuun pa</char> putuunaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:10">efikayeno pumansa pa pakati etaam ya.”<verse eid="REV 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 5:11" />Innene sincan, incuk hícump pumaleekoo, piyema púwuli niŋ pimiliyoŋ.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:10">Dañel 7:10</ref></char></note> Mpíkiipool elemeyu ya niŋ lompo waah wa upaakiil wa weeyem wa kaloŋa niŋ ñíhampaatiin ña. Insí kilim etempo, <verse eid="REV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 5:12" />mpiyeno caacook meemak, pupusok:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">“Císaacii ca ceetaaŋee ca hínum</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:12">cítuunaatuuno</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">kati cisa kayine niŋ hisaanumate,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:12">ecohato niŋ sempe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:12">kámakiyan, hamake niŋ hímulu!”<verse eid="REV 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 5:13" />Fiye ínsi waah wa púlooŋ weeliilee wa alacana, niŋ t’etaam ya, niŋ páhantuwa etaam ya, niŋ ti kaatii ka, niŋ waah óo waah weeyem ti púlunta pa púlooŋ ti caacook, ti hisoku:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:13">“Alímaati eeyeniye ya ti elemeyu ya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:13">niŋ Císaacii ca</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:13">kataak hímulu niŋ kámakiyan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:13">hamake niŋ sempe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:13">fo cancowiyaaw púley!”<verse eid="REV 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 5:14" />Waah wa upaakiil wa weeyem wa kaloŋa nuusok, “Amíini”, ñíhampaatiin ña nkákilipo nkámul Pútuun pa niŋ Císaacii ca.<verse eid="REV 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="REV 6" />
  <para style="s">Pasotal sontel piyema isak niŋ púsupak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 6:1" />Púful toko, incuk Císaacii ca íncifulane pasotal sontel ya píyaañ pa ti pasotal isak niŋ púsupak pa. Insí woonool ti waah wa upaakiil wa weeyem wa kaloŋa ti hisoku niŋ hilim heeceeke samat nii pasapal etiil, upusok: “Kéy!” <verse eid="REV 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 6:2" />Fiye, insincan incuk hátikinam efalinc eehiina!<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 1:8">Sakaliya 1:8</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 6:1-8">6:1-8</ref></char></note> Ateteyana ya ateyyo naayekan hiŋaaceen, naawufanee éwuulu eti amansa. Naakaay apica aheek hícump hikam, naayeno eeheeke ya.<verse eid="REV 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 6:3" />Císaacii ca íncifulan pasotal pa púsupiyenu pa, ínsi úsupiyenu wa ti waah wa weeyem wa kaloŋa ti hisoku: “Kéy!” <verse eid="REV 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 6:4" />Fiye intaak nene ekee efalinc éekeyii, éecunke samat nii seemak. Ateteyana ya ateyyo naawufanee sempe ápufulan kásuumaay ka ti etaam ya, náahin pakan paka kápumukalool. Naawufanee káakuntu kenfakat.<verse eid="REV 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 6:5" />Císaacii ca íncifulan pasotal pa píhaaciyenu pa, ínsi úhaaciyenu wa ti waah wa weeyem wa kaloŋa ti hisoku: “Kéy!” Fiye, insincan, incuk hátikinam efalinc eepaana! Ateteyana ya ateyyo naayekan éniikuma ti epeesoo eti hiniiku panape paliyal. <verse eid="REV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 6:6" />Innene sí hilim héefulii ti pututa waah wa upaakiil wa weeyem wa kaloŋa, ti hisoku: “Náalafiyaa uli, aañaŋa écoopii cooy áhina hinoom púmpuluŋ aapunoom kilo yoonool; náalafiyaa ñóo, aañaŋa écoopii cooy áhina hinoom púmpuluŋ aapunoom sikilo síhaaciil; timpi púcalool lúuliin ya eti olif ya niŋ elaan ya eti wiiñ ya!”<verse eid="REV 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 6:7" />Císaacii ca íncifulan pasotal pa pípaakiilenu pa, ínsi hilim ha hiti waah wa úpaakiilenu wa weeyem wa kaloŋa, ti hisoku: “Kéy!” <verse eid="REV 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 6:8" />Fiye, insincan incuk hátikinam ekee efalinc, kapaŋ eteyyo nkinakool nii pahatal peesuuce! Ateteyana ya ateyyo caacawoo Eket, cáwii ca citi keekete ka inciyeniyoo kanapan. Nkawufanee sempe ti himpaac hoonool ti kimpaac kipaakiil kiti etaam ya, kati kamuk pakan paka ti hikam, épankul, hítaapanu úkuuñu, niŋ púlukuleen elampa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 14:21">Esekiyel 14:21</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 6:9" />Císaacii ca íncifulan pasotal pa písakiyenu pa, incuk t’etaam taapuloo ya eeyem ya <char style="w">kaaciin</char> ka saan sa siti keemukee ka kamma nkátuule hilim ha hiti Pútuun nkátuunan ho. <verse eid="REV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 6:10" />Nkáceekii meemak kapusok: “<char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> Pútuun, awe eekuule ya íyyemi páni ya, fo teyme ankaakaay hítuulu le niŋ áafahin kíiti keeyem ka ti <char style="w">púlunta pa</char> áapunukan hísim ha hitoonii?” <verse eid="REV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 6:11" />Fiye an óo an teyii naawufanee hísool henfakat heehiina. Nkasokee kátuul caahinkilis, kaatuko pákawiyii pimiikan, keeyem ka pakanii ti káyinan, pakakee teyii kañaŋee himuku samat nii poko.<verse eid="REV 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 6:12" />Púful toko, incuk Císaacii ca íncifulane pasotal pa peewase pa isak niŋ poonool, intaako páyiyiŋanal etaam penfakat. Caanak ca ínciyenoonii ceepaana samat nii hísool hiti acoka kafonkoloŋ, hiim ha púlooŋ níhiyenoonii héecunke samat nii hísim. <verse eid="REV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 6:13" />Fiye picaaŋaŋ pa piti útiŋu wa mpúnowii ti etaam ya samat nii fa papukal sootoo peeyanut mpúnowii fa ti enuun sootoo niŋ hiyam henfakat híyiyiŋanaa yo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:10-13">Esayi 13:10-13</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:7-8">Esekiyel 32:7-8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 8:9">Amos 8:9</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:10">Sowel 2:10</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:15-16">3:15-16</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="REV 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 6:14" />Káahaaŋ ka kiti patiila nkupoonee samat nii kaahit, nkícim; pítintiŋ pa púlooŋ niŋ pucon pa púlooŋ mpúfulanee ti káasiiŋuma etempo.<verse eid="REV 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 6:15" />Fiye, pumansa pa pakati etaam ya niŋ keemaka ka, pakati kikaw ka pakati pusoocaali pa, kusaanum ka, pakati sempe sa, niŋ an óo an eeyem amiikan niŋ fotom eeneetaat ti himiikanate, poko púlooŋ nkayolo ti uyeen niŋ ti pínankiin pa piti pítintiŋ pa. <verse eid="REV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 6:16" />Nkayonkal pítintiŋ pa niŋ pínankiin pa ti hiceeku, kapusok: “Nínowii ti unii nipiyol unii úpulaaŋ puhooŋu pa piti eeyeniye ya ti <char style="w">elemeyu</char> ya niŋ lompo káñiken ka kiti Císaacii ca.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 10:8">Hoseya 10:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 6:17" />Kaatuko hinoom ha henfakat ha hiti káñiken ka kiteyii hícoliyoocol, fo ayme ayina ho hifaku?”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 2:11">Sowel 2:11</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:2-3">Sofoniya 2:2-3</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 6:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="REV 7" />
  <para style="s">Pakati Israyel síwuli keme niŋ áwii ésupak niŋ pakapaakiil (144,000) kéelankamaasiyee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 7:1" />Eehuu hipimuus, incuk <char style="w" lemma="Maleekoo">simaleekoo</char> sipaakiil insisiiŋiye ti sitonkoŋ sa sipaakiil sa siti etaam ya. Insicok eyam ya éefulii ya ti tonkoŋ óo tonkoŋ<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 49:36">Jeremiya 49:36</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:2">Dañel 7:2</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 6:5">Sakaliya 6:5</ref></char></note> sipikit eyam óo eyam ésapii ti etaam ya niŋ ti kaatii ka niŋ ti enuun óo enuun. <verse eid="REV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 7:2" />Insiwufanee sempe siti hípucu etaam ya niŋ kaatii ka. Fiye, incuk ekee maleekoo ti éfulii pa caanak ca íncifulii pa, neeyekan éhinuma lánkamaasi ya eti Pútuun pa peeyem pa kaloŋa. Néeyonkalii simaleekoo sa sipaakiil sa niŋ hilim heeceeke, <verse eid="REV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 7:3" />neesok: “Timpi nípuc fala etaam ya niŋ kaatii ka niŋ punuun pa taamanta uwasut lánkamaasi ti píyit pimiikan pa pakati Pútuun pa putuunaa.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 9:4-6">Esekiyel 9:4-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 7:4" />Fiye ínsi nii pakan kayema síwuli keme niŋ áwii ésupak niŋ pakapaakiil (144,000) káhinee lánkamaasi ti písii pa púlooŋ piti <char style="w">Israyel</char>.<verse eid="REV 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 7:5" />Ti síi ya eti <char style="w">Juda</char>, pakan síwuli ŋaasuwan niŋ pákasupak (12,000) káhinee lánkamaasi;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 7:5">ti síi ya eti Ruben, pakan síwuli ŋaasuwan niŋ pákasupak (12,000) káhinee lánkamaasi;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 7:5">ti síi ya eti Gad, pakan síwuli ŋaasuwan niŋ pákasupak (12,000) káhinee lánkamaasi;<verse eid="REV 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 7:6" />ti síi ya eti Asel, pakan síwuli ŋaasuwan niŋ pákasupak (12,000) káhinee lánkamaasi;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 7:6">ti síi ya eti Nafatali, pakan síwuli ŋaasuwan niŋ pákasupak (12,000) káhinee lánkamaasi;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 7:6">ti síi ya eti Manase, pakan síwuli ŋaasuwan niŋ pákasupak (12,000) káhinee lánkamaasi;<verse eid="REV 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 7:7" />ti síi ya eti Simeyon, pakan síwuli ŋaasuwan niŋ pákasupak (12,000) káhinee lánkamaasi;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 7:7">ti síi ya eti Lewi, pakan síwuli ŋaasuwan niŋ pákasupak (12,000) káhinee lánkamaasi;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 7:7">ti síi ya eti Isakaal, pakan síwuli ŋaasuwan niŋ pákasupak (12,000) káhinee lánkamaasi;<verse eid="REV 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 7:8" />ti síi ya eti Sepulun, pakan síwuli ŋaasuwan niŋ pákasupak (12,000) káhinee lánkamaasi;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 7:8">ti síi ya eti <char style="w">Josef</char>, pakan síwuli ŋaasuwan niŋ pákasupak (12,000) káhinee lánkamaasi;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 7:8">ti síi ya eti Benjamin, pakan síwuli ŋaasuwan niŋ pákasupak (12,000) káhinee lánkamaasi.<verse eid="REV 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kayoŋ kenfakat kéesooliye wañ weehiina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 7:9" />Eehuu hipimuus, incuk hátikinam kayoŋ kenfakat enka an naayinaat kafinu, kéefulii ti mah óo mah, ti síi óo síi, ti pakan óo pakan, niŋ ti híleeluuf óo híleeluuf, nkasiiŋiye hátikin <char style="w">elemeyu</char> ya niŋ Císaacii ca. Nkawaso kúsool kenfakat keehiina, nkayekanal ti sipeesii ékunt. <verse eid="REV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 7:10" />Nkáceekii meemak, kapusok:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:10">“Kafakan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:10">ti Pútuun pa putuunaa niŋ ti Císaacii ca náafulii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:10">peeyeniye pa ti elemeyu ya.”<verse eid="REV 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 7:11" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Maleekoo">Pumaleekoo</char> pa púlooŋ mpisiiŋo pípikiipool elemeyu ya, mpíkiipool lompo ñíhampaatiin ña niŋ waah wa upaakiil wa weeyem wa kaloŋa. Nkákilipo ñuhooŋuyii t’etaam hátikin elemeyu ya, nkámul Pútuun pa. <verse eid="REV 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 7:12" />Nkasok:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">“Amíini!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">Alímaati Pútuun pa putuunaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:12">pitaak hímulu niŋ hamake,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:12">ecohato niŋ hisoku apalaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:12">kámakiyan, sempe niŋ kayine</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:12">fo cancowiyaaw púley!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">Amíini!”<verse eid="REV 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 7:13" />Fiye akee ti ñíhampaatiin ña naacakanam: “Kéesooliye ka wañ wa weehiina wa kayem pakayme? Peyme nkáfulii?” <verse eid="REV 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 7:14" />Iññahanoo: “Ahámpaatiin, awe meya.” Naasokam: “Payenke kayem kéefulii ka ti kaakallanee ka kenfakat ka.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:1">Dañel 12:1</ref></char></note> Kañowaañow wañ wa uteyii ti hísim ha hiti Císaacii ca núuhiiniyanee. <verse eid="REV 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 7:15" />Ekina ewune,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:15">nkasiiŋo hátikin elemeyu ya eti Pútuun pa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:15">nkawaaseen Pútuun pa hánant hanakan la sampanee la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:15">Aŋa eeyeniye ya ti elemeyu ya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:15">akina himuumoo, afaakin neyii naafaasii.<verse eid="REV 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 7:16" />Peep niŋ pálaani etinene pucokii;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:16">pisiya pa etinene pusowii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:16">niŋ fotom pasowe óo pasowe.<verse eid="REV 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 7:17" />Kaatuko Císaacii ca ceeyem ca ti pututa elemeyu ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:17">eficimankoolii samat nii afaasa písaacii;<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 34:23">Esekiyel 34:23</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:17">éficitintiŋanii ti úpun uti man miti eloŋ.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 23:1-2">Kícimu 23:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:10">Esayi 49:10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:17">Pútuun pa efiputoot mukun óo mukun ti ñíkinii.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 25:8">Esayi 25:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="REV 8" />
  <para style="s">Pasotal pa peewase pa isak niŋ púsupak pa niŋ éluntanuma eti sanoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 8:1" />Púful toko, Císaacii ca íncifulan pasotal pa peewase pa isak niŋ púsupak, alacana neekeman fo kancaŋ waati yoonool. <verse eid="REV 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 8:2" />Fiye incuk <char style="w" lemma="Maleekoo">simaleekoo</char> sa isak niŋ súsupak sa seesiiŋiye sa hátikin Pútuun pa, insiwufanee úmpiis isak niŋ úsupak. <verse eid="REV 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 8:3" />Ekee maleekoo, eeyekane éluntanuma eti sanoo, néekey neesiiŋo ti taapuloo ya eeyem ya <char style="w">kaaciin</char> ka.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:1-3">Efúlii 30:1-3</ref></char></note> Neewufanee hícump caminkoloŋ kati ewas yo ti éluntanuma ya kati enapool niŋ kaluum ka kiti pakan paka púlooŋ <char style="w">keesampanee ka pakati Pútuun pa</char>, neewaaseen yo ti taapuloo ya eti sanoo ya eeyem ya kaaciin ka keesiiŋiye ka hátikin <char style="w">elemeyu</char> ya. <verse eid="REV 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 8:4" />Háaputa ha hiti caminkoloŋ eyyuu, ti coonool niŋ kaluum ka kiti pakan paka keesampanee ka, nkisilo pati Pútuun pa púfulii ti epees maleekoo ya. <verse eid="REV 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 8:5" />Fiye maleekoo ya neemeeŋan éluntanuma eti sanoo ya niŋ seemak séefulii ti kaaciin ka,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:12">Lewitik 16:12</ref></char></note> neewiisal so ti etaam ya,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 10:2">Esekiyel 10:2</ref></char></note> intaak pasapal etiil, pahampanane, pamaliñoolal etiil niŋ páyiyiŋanal etaam.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:16">Efúlii 19:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umpíis wa isak niŋ úsupak wa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 8:6" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Maleekoo">Simaleekoo</char> sa isak niŋ súsupak sa seeyekane sa úmpiis wa isak niŋ úsupak wa, insimemanoolo kati sisap wo.<verse eid="REV 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 8:7" />Maleekoo ya éyaañ ya neesap kámpiis eteyyo, etiil eti pukumpul niŋ seemak seenakanooliye niŋ hísim ínsiwiisaniyee ti etaam ya.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 9:23-24">Efúlii 9:23-24</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 38:22">Esekiyel 38:22</ref></char></note> Himpaac hoonool ti kimpaac kíhaaciil kiti etaam ya nihisowo, himpaac hoonool ti kimpaac kíhaaciil ti punuun pa nihisowo fo hileem motic, niŋ lompo píheeni pa púlooŋ peemaaña pa mpusowo fo pileem motic.<verse eid="REV 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 8:8" />Maleekoo ya ésupiyenu ya neesap kámpiis eteyyo, waah weecuke samat nii tíntiŋ enfakat eti seemak, nuuwantee ti kaatii ka. Himpaac hoonool ti kimpaac kíhaaciil ti kaatii ka nihiyeso hísim, <verse eid="REV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 8:9" />himpaac hoonool ti kimpaac kíhaaciil ti waah wa weeyem wa kaloŋa ti kaatii ka nuuketal, himpaac hoonool ti kimpaac kíhaaciil lompo ti ñiteen ña ñenfakat ña íññipucaloolee.<verse eid="REV 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 8:10" />Maleekoo ya éhaaciyenu ya neesap kámpiis eteyyo, ecaaŋaŋ enfakat éeceeke nii lampi, néenowii púfulii ti útiŋu wa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:12">Esayi 14:12</ref></char></note> Neenow ti himpaac hoonool ti kimpaac kíhaaciil ka kiti kiyanu ka niŋ úpun wa. <verse eid="REV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 8:11" />Ecaaŋaŋ ya caacaw eteyyo Pasampe. Néehin himpaac hoonool ti kimpaac kíhaaciil kiti man ma hípisampi, hícump pakan nkaket kamma man ma, kaatuko meesampa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:15">Jeremiya 9:15</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 8:12" />Maleekoo ya épaakiilenu ya neesap kámpiis eteyyo, himpaac hoonool ti kimpaac kíhaaciil ti caanak ca nihisapee, himpaac hoonool ti kimpaac kíhaaciil ti hiim ha, niŋ himpaac hoonool ti kimpaac kíhaaciil ti picaaŋaŋ pa níhikuuteen. Himpaac hoonool ti kimpaac kíhaaciil ti hanakan ha níhinim,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 10:21-23">Efúlii 10:21-23</ref></char></note> niŋ lompo himpaac hoonool ti kimpaac kíhaaciil ti hánant ha.<verse eid="REV 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 8:13" />Fiye insincan, ínsi hisiwita heeyeniye káyitu patiila eyam ya, nihisok niŋ hilim heeceeke: “Kúnuul! Kúnuul! Kúnuul efikiyeno ti keekine ka ti etaam ya, kamma heekaakaay ha pitaako niŋ simaleekoo sa síhaaciil sa seetowiye sa sisapaa úmpiis etenso!”<verse eid="REV 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="REV 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 9:1" />Púful toko, <char style="w">maleekoo</char> ya ésakiyenu ya neesap kámpiis eteyyo, incuk ecaaŋaŋ éenowii t’etaam épufulii ti útiŋu wa. Ecaaŋaŋ ya neewufanee ékululuma ya eti putum pa piti kaayeen ka keetaakut ka pilehu. <verse eid="REV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 9:2" />Ta néepankine ta kaayeen ka, háaputa níhifulii tenko samat nii háaputa héefulii ti seemak senfakat séeceeke.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:28">Púcook 19:28</ref></char></note> Háaputa ha héefulii ha ti kaayeen ka níhipaaniyan caanak ca niŋ eyam ya. <verse eid="REV 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 9:3" />Ti háaputa eehuu, pukoskos mpúfulii mpiyeno ti etaam ya,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 10:12-15">Efúlii 10:12-15</ref></char></note> mpuwufanee sempe samat nii siti púpuntaloo pa piti etaam ya. <verse eid="REV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 9:4" />Mpusokee timpi pílik píheeni pa piti etaam ya niŋ fotom pasukal niŋ fotom punuun, pale pakan paka lamma keetaakut ka lánkamaasi ya eti Pútuun pa ti píyitii. <verse eid="REV 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 9:5" />Pukoskos pa mpikitee himukuyii pale kati pikallanii lamma fo kiim isak. Ñíseeña eñña nkacuke ña iññicuk samat nii palifal púntaloo. <verse eid="REV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 9:6" />Ti kiim isak enkuu, pakan paka efikaŋes eket pale etikataak yo, nkálafi eket pale eket ya efeeteyii.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 3:21">Job 3:21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 8:3">Jeremiya 8:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 9:7" />Pukoskos pa mpucuk fiye nii pufalinc peesiiŋiye hikam. Ti kikaw etempo mpuwaso waah weecuke nii éwuulu amansa eti sanoo, ñuhooŋu etempo mpinakool nii ñuhooŋu pakan. <verse eid="REV 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 9:8" />Wan etempo samat nii uti aal, úŋiiŋ etempo samat nii uti picata. <verse eid="REV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 9:9" />Mpuwaso hísool hiti éfaasuma púsus peecuke nii mañ, pasokal úpitu etempo samat nii piti hícump pufalinc piti pisalet peeyem ti pikaayu hikam.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 1:6">Sowel 1:6</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:4-5">2:4-5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 9:10" />Pukoskos pa mpitaak kíyeeni niŋ palifal samat nii piti púntaloo, ti kíyeeni etempo mpitaak sempe siti kaakallan pakan fo kiim isak. <verse eid="REV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 9:11" />Nkataak amansa, akina ayem maleekoo ya eti kaayeen ka keetaakut ka pilehu, caacaw eteyyo ti kaŋ ya eti <char style="w" lemma="Ahiburu">Hiburu</char> ekina eyem “Apaton”, ti kaŋ ya eti Kilek ekina eyem “Apoliyon” (ekina eyem “Apúcaloola ya”).<verse eid="REV 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 9:12" />Kúnuul ka kíyaañ ka kumuusaa, nisincan, kikee kúnuul kúsupak unka ti pítin.<verse eid="REV 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 9:13" />Maleekoo ya eewase ya isak niŋ yoonool neesap kámpiis eteyyo, ínsi hilim héefulii ti usiin wa upaakiil wa uti taapuloo ya eti sanoo ya, eeyem ya <char style="w">kaaciin</char> ka keeyem ka hátikin Pútuun pa <verse eid="REV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 9:14" />Hilim ha nihisok maleekoo ya eewase ya isak niŋ yoonool eetaake ya kámpiis ka: “Katan simaleekoo sa sipaakiil sa seecenkee sa ti musuu ma menfakat ma miti Efalat.” <verse eid="REV 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 9:15" />Fiye simaleekoo sa sipaakiil sa seememanoolee sa kamma waati eyye, hinoom eehe, hiim eehe niŋ etiil eyye, insikatanee kati simuk himpaac hoonool ti kimpaac kíhaaciil kiti pakan paka ti etaam ya. <verse eid="REV 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 9:16" />Insí nii pusoocaali pa keelapiye ka ti pufalinc pa payenkuu kayema similiyoŋ sikeme súsupak (200,000,000). <verse eid="REV 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 9:17" />Pufalinc pa niŋ piteteyana pa payenka inci incuke ka pucuk fiye nii éyawut, fiye nkacuke: nkawaso kúsool kiti éfaasuma púsus kéecunke nii seemak, kéefuule nii útiŋu wéemaahe, watañii nii haafol ékili eesokanee. Kikaw pufalinc pa nkucuk nii kikaw picata. Seemak, háaputa niŋ haafol ékili níhifulii ti ñutum etempo. <verse eid="REV 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 9:18" />Hítaapanu waah wa úhaaciil ewwe, seemak sa, háaputa ha, niŋ haafol ékili ya, wéefulii wa ti ñutum etempo, nuumuk himpaac hoonool ti kimpaac kíhaaciil ti pakan paka ti etaam ya. <verse eid="REV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 9:19" />Kaatuko sempe sa siti pufalinc pa unsa ti ñutum etempo niŋ kíyeeni etempo; kíyeeni etempo kucukaacuk nii pupululoola, nkitaak kikaw enka nkukuum nenko pakan paka.<verse eid="REV 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 9:20" />Pakan paka keetowiye ka payenka hítaapanu ha nihimukut ka nkapook púwunko páhinalii peenaput pa. Kaatuko káyekuniit hímulu <char style="w" lemma="Hísaalumant">kísaalumant</char>, pínaati piti sanoo, piti kótifoloo, piti mañ, piti énankiin niŋ piti pupapaloo,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 5:4">Dañel 5:4</ref>,<ref loc="DAN 5:23">23</ref></char></note> pínaati peeyinaat hicuku, hísiyu niŋ pikaayu.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 115:4-7">Kícimu 115:4-7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 135:15-17">135:15-17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 9:21" />Káwunkiit kamukal ka kiteyii pakan, kaasaay ka kiteyii, casupoolat ca citeyii niŋ fotom káalipu ka kiteyii.<verse eid="REV 9:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="REV 10" />
  <para style="s">Maleekoo ya niŋ cihit ca ceepoonee ca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 10:1" />Fiye incuk ekee <char style="w">maleekoo</char> eti sempe ti éfulii alacana épuwanoonii. Káatiŋu nkíkiipool yo, étiifeel neeyeno patiila hikaw eteyyo; puhooŋu eteyyo samat nii caanak ca, woot eteyyo samat nii pisafu piti seemak. <verse eid="REV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 10:2" />Neeyekan ti epees eteyyo cihit ceepoonee céepankinee. Neesiiŋan koot eteyyo káali ti kaatii ka, koot eteyyo kaamay ti etaam ya. <verse eid="REV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 10:3" />Neeceek meemak samat nii pasokal cata. Ta neeceeke ta, kilim ka kiti pasapal etiil ya isak niŋ kúsupak ka nkúkup. <verse eid="REV 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 10:4" />Ta pasapal etiil ya isak niŋ púsupak pa mpúkupe ta, insiiŋo kati kiic; pale ínsi hilim héefulii alacana heesoke: “Yol eeha pasapal etiil ya isak niŋ púsupak pa mpusoke ha, timpi kiic ho.” <verse eid="REV 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 10:5" />Fiye maleekoo ya eyya inci incuke ya neesiiŋiye ti kaatii ka niŋ ti etaam ya, néeseepin epees eteyyo yáali alacana episintoolo. <verse eid="REV 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 10:6" />Neesintoolo ti Pútuun pa peeyem pa kaloŋa fo cancowiyaaw púley,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:40">Kakaman 32:40</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:7">Dañel 12:7</ref></char></note> peeliile pa patiila niŋ waah óo waah weeyem toko, etaam ya niŋ waah óo waah teyyo, niŋ kaatii ka niŋ waah óo waah weeyem tenko. Maleekoo ya neesok: “Fiye etifiyo. <verse eid="REV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 10:7" />Pale ta maleekoo ya eewase ya isak niŋ súsupak ya neekaakaay ta hisapu kámpiis eteyyo, Pútuun pa éfipihin eeha mpihintane ha, eeha an náamiit ha hínum, samat nii fa mpútuunane fa pimiikan etempo <char style="w" lemma="Ayaamakoola">piyaamakoola</char> pa.”<verse eid="REV 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 10:8" />Fiye hilim ha eeha inci ínsiye ha héefulii ha alacana níhikup niŋ inci nene, nihisok: “Kaay, coop cihit ca céepankinee ca ínciyemi ti epees maleekoo ya eesiiŋiye ya ti kaatii ka niŋ ti etaam ya.” <verse eid="REV 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 10:9" />Fiye inci inkaay pati maleekoo ya insok yo ewufanam cihit ca. Neesokam, “Coop co illi co. Efícisampiyan munowi, pale ti putumi éficisuum nii múkum.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 2:8-10">Esekiyel 2:8-10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 3:1-3">3:1-3</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="REV 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 10:10" />Incoop cihit ca ti epees maleekoo ya illi co. Incísuum ti putumam samat nii múkum, pale ta inci immelane co ta, munowam ímmisampi. <verse eid="REV 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 10:11" />Inci insokee: “Fo aayaamakool nene kiti hícump pakan, kiti hícump mah, kiti hícump kíleeluuf niŋ kiti hícump pumansa.”<verse eid="REV 10:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="REV 11" />
  <para style="s">Keetantake ka pákasupak paka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 11:1" />Fiye uwwufanee hikasap hiti hiniiku, insokee: “Kaay caaniik <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char> niŋ taapuloo ya eeyem ya <char style="w">kaaciin</char> ka,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:3">Esekiyel 40:3</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 2:1-2">Sakaliya 2:1-2</ref></char></note> infin keeyem ka toko ti kaawaaseen. <verse eid="REV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 11:2" />Pale timpi niik hank eteyyo heeyem ha tíkitaaŋ, kamma nihiwufanee kéemiit ka Pútuun pa. Efikakakalool kápuwiiniyan saatee ya eesampanee ya fo kiim áwii ésupak niŋ kúsupak (42). <verse eid="REV 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 11:3" />Inci fapoñ keetantake ka pakatoom pákasupak paka, éfikasoolo kúsool kiti pupootak, nkayaamakool fo kunoom wúli niŋ sikeme súsupak niŋ áwii éhaaciil (1,260).” <verse eid="REV 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 11:4" />Keetantake ka pákasupak paka payenkuu kacukaacuk nii sinuun olif sa súsupak sa niŋ písiiŋanuma lampi ya súsupak sa<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 4:3-14">Sakaliya 4:3-14</ref></char></note> seesiiŋiye sa hátikin <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> ati etaam ya. <verse eid="REV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 11:5" />Niŋ an álafiyii hikuumu, seemak éfisifulii ti ñutumii insisow pikamoolii motic. Fiyuu an óo an éelafiyii hikuumu naañaŋe eket. <verse eid="REV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 11:6" />Nkataak kayine kiti hicoku etiil ya timpi enup ti caanak enca nkayem ca ti kaayaamakool.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:1">1 Pumansa 17:1</ref></char></note> Nkataak kayine kiti kayesan man óo man hísim<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 7:17-19">Efúlii 7:17-19</ref></char></note> niŋ kiti étahii ti etaam ya hítaapanu óo hítaapanu tan óo tan nkálafiye.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 4:8">1 Samiyel 4:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 11:7" />Fiye nkapayaa kakaman eeha nkatantake ha, élukuleen elampa ya<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:7-22">Dañel 7:7-22</ref></char></note> eeyem ya ti kaayeen ka keetaakut ka pilehu efeelaakiyii, neeheekii neemukii. <verse eid="REV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 11:8" />Puhunuŋ pa piteyii efipiyeno ti híliŋ ha hiti saatee ya enfakat ya eyya nkayonkal ya ti caacaw ciwaswas Sotom<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18">Púcook 18</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 19">19</ref></char></note> niŋ fotom <char style="w">Esipt</char>, ti saatee eyyuu lompo Ateeteyo naapempeŋee ti <char style="w">kuluwaa</char>. <verse eid="REV 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 11:9" />Pakan éfikafulii ti <char style="w">púlunta pa</char> púlooŋ, ti síi óo síi niŋ híleeluuf óo híleeluuf kapisincan ti pásuuma puhunuŋ pa piteyii fo kunoom kíhaaciil niŋ kancaŋ, nkakitii ihokuyee. <verse eid="REV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 11:10" />Pakan paka púlooŋ pakati púlunta pa éfisuumii kamma eket ya eti pákasupak paka payenkuu. Efikahaaño eket ya eteyii nkawufanool uwun kamma <char style="w" lemma="Ayaamakoola">piyaamakoola</char> pa pákasupak paka payenkuu nkácoopii kúnuul kenfakat ti etaam ya.<verse eid="REV 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 11:11" />Pale pamuusal kunoom ka kíhaaciil niŋ kancaŋ ya, esuuŋut eti eloŋ néefulii pati Pútuun pa neenakiyii, nkasiiŋo ti wootii.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 37">Esekiyel 37</ref></char></note> An óo an eecukii naafe meemak. <verse eid="REV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 11:12" />Fiye piyaamakoola pa pákasupak paka nkási hilim heeceeke héefulii alacana, nihisokii: “Nísiloonii le!” Nkasilo alacana ti káatiŋu,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 2:11">2 Pumansa 2:11</ref></char></note> pikamoolii ti kaasincan.<verse eid="REV 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 11:13" />Ti oom káasiiŋuma etaam ya néeyiyiŋan meemak, kaapii koonool ti upii ŋaasuwan ti saatee ya nkunow. Pakan síwuli isak niŋ pákasupak (7,000) kakete ti páyiyiŋanal etaam eyyuu, keetowiye ka nkafe nkasayan nii Pútuun pa piti alacana pímakimaki. <verse eid="REV 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 11:14" />Kúnuul ka kúsupiyenu ka kumuusaa; nisincan, kíhaaciyenu ka unka ti ékey toko fiye.<verse eid="REV 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kámpiis ka keewase ka isak niŋ kúsupak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 11:15" />
    <char style="w">Maleekoo</char> ya eewase ya isak niŋ súsupak neesap kámpiis eteyyo, kilim keeceeke nkúfulii alacana, keesoke:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:15">“Cáwii ca citi <char style="w">púlunta pa</char> cíyenooniyoo <char style="w" lemma="Cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa">cáwii</char> ca citi <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> atuunaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:15">niŋ citi <char style="w">Eenucee ya</char> ateyoo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:15">afaayeno ti <char style="w">elemeyu</char> ya fo cancowiyaaw púley!”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:18">Efúlii 15:18</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 2:44">Dañel 2:44</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:14">7:14</ref>,<ref loc="DAN 7:27">27</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 11:16" />Ñíhampaatiin ña áwii niŋ pakapaakiil paka, keeyeniye ka ti pilemeyu pa piteyii hátikin Pútuun pa, nkákilipo ñuhooŋuyii t’etaam nkámul Pútuun pa, <verse eid="REV 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 11:17" />nkasok:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">“Usokuu apalaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:17">Ateeteyo Pútuun pa piti sempe sa púlooŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">Aŋa eeyem a niŋ eetaakiye ya hínum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:17">kamma ancoope sempe sa sitii senfakat sa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:17">íyyaañ piyeno amansa.<verse eid="REV 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 11:18" />Pakan paka pakati púlunta pa nkáñiken,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:1">Kícimu 2:1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">pale káñiken ka kitii nkíkey.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">Caanak ca cícoliyoo íhinu kíiti keekete ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">niŋ kaapuuñanool pimiikan pa pakatii <char style="w" lemma="Ayaamakoola">piyaamakoola</char> pa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">niŋ pakani púlooŋ <char style="w" lemma="Keesampanee ka pakati Pútuun pa">keesampanee ka</char> keefeye ka caacawi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">keemaka ka niŋ kenkilis ka,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 115:12-13">Kícimu 115:12-13</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">niŋ káapucalool kéepucaloole ka etaam ya.”<verse eid="REV 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 11:19" />
    <char style="w">Ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char> eeyem ya alacana néepankino, páhantuwa eteyyo ínnake ya eti <char style="w">písiyool</char> pa neecukee. Intaako pamaliñoolal, pahampanane, pasapal etiil, páyiyiŋanal etaam niŋ etiil eti pitaali penfakat.<verse eid="REV 11:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="REV 12" />
  <para style="s">Aal a niŋ nínkinankoo ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 12:1" />Píyisan penfakat mpúfulii alacana: aal éesooliye caanak ca, hiim ha nihiyeno t’etaam wootoo, éwuulu eti amansa eetaake sicaaŋaŋ ŋaasuwan niŋ súsupak ti hikawoo. <verse eid="REV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 12:2" />Naayeno niŋ munow, niŋ hiceeku ti ñíseeña akina ti ékey hipuku. <verse eid="REV 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 12:3" />Fiye pikee píyisan nene púfulii alacana: nínkinankoo enfakat éecunke samat nii seemak, neetaak kikaw isak niŋ kúsupak, usiin ŋaasuwan niŋ síwuulu siti amansa siyema isak niŋ súsupak ti hikaw eteyyo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:7">Dañel 7:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 12:4" />Híyeeni eteyyo nihineeŋ máamun himpaac hoonool ti kimpaac kíhaaciil kiti picaaŋaŋ pa ti útiŋu wa, níhiwantii po ti etaam ya.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:10">Dañel 8:10</ref></char></note> Nínkinankoo ya enfakat ya neesiiŋo hátikin aal a eeyem a ti ékey hipuku ancuk kati eli añiinoo papukalee. <verse eid="REV 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 12:5" />Aal a náapukii ciñii cikampaani, enca eficiyeno ati hikaw ha ati <char style="w">púlunta pa</char> púlooŋ, íncitintiŋanii niŋ hikasap hiti mañ.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:7">Esayi 66:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:9">Kícimu 2:9</ref></char></note> Pale añiinoo náalamutee apucoopee patiila pati Pútuun pa ti <char style="w">elemeyu</char> ya eteyoo. <verse eid="REV 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 12:6" />Fiye aal a naatey pati <char style="w">káahaaŋ ka tes</char> la Pútuun pa mpimemanooloo la, kati amankoolee fo kunoom wúli niŋ sikeme súsupak niŋ áwii éhaaciil (1,260).<verse eid="REV 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 12:7" />Hikam nihitaako alacana. <char style="w">Maleekoo</char> ya enfakat ya eyya nkasok ya Misel niŋ pumaleekoo eteyyo nkátaakoolan nínkinankoo ya, nínkinankoo ya niŋ pumaleekoo eteyyo lompo nkásiiŋoonii kápitaakool. <verse eid="REV 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 12:8" />Pale nínkinankoo ya neeheekee ti hikam ha, ekina niŋ pumaleekoo eteyyo nkayaanee alacana. <verse eid="REV 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 12:9" />Nínkinankoo ya enfakat ya néewantiyee t’etaam, niŋ pumaleekoo eteyyo. Ekina eyem epululoola ya étuuta ya eyya nesokee ya Akamool a, niŋ fotom <char style="w">Seetaani</char> ya, eelincane ya púlunta pa púlooŋ.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:1">Púcook 3:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 12:10" />Fiye ínsi hilim heeceeke alacana heesoke:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:10">“Fiye kafakan ka kiti Pútuun pa kúcoliyoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:10">Pútuun pa píyisanaayisan sempe etempo nii amansa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:10">
    <char style="w">Eenucee ya</char> atempo áyisanaayisan kayine ka kiteyoo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:10">Kaatuko eesiiŋiye ya hátikin Pútuun pa piti unaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:10">nanook pakan unaa ti káyinan hánant hanakan,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:6-11">Job 1:6-11</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 3:1-2">Sakaliya 3:1-2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:10">áwantiyeewant t’etaam.<verse eid="REV 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 12:11" />Kaheekooheek pínapii ti hísim ha hiti Císaacii ca</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:11">niŋ ti tooñaa ya eyya nkátuunane ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:11">kálafiit eloŋii meemak apan kafeyut eket.<verse eid="REV 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 12:12" />Ekina ewune, awe alacana niŋ aluu keekine ka po,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:12">nitaak pásuuma!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:12">Pale kúnuul kiyeno ti etaam ya niŋ kaatii ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:12">kamma Seetaani ya néewanoonii ti aluu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:12">Yoopiya éñikene fúf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:12">kamma neemeya nii caanak eteyyo cítamitami.”<verse eid="REV 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 12:13" />Ta nínkinankoo ya néepannume ta nii éwantiyeewant ti etaam ya, neetey niŋ aal a eepuke ya ciñii ca cikampaani ca. <verse eid="REV 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 12:14" />Pale aal a naawufanee úpitu úsupak uti hisiwita henfakat, ancuk kati áyit apikaay ti káahaaŋ ka tes pa memanoolee pa kati akin. Po afaamankoolee fo sitiil síhaaciil niŋ kancaŋ.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:25">Dañel 7:25</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:7">12:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 12:15" />Nínkinankoo ya néelafi kaahootan aal a, néefulanii man ti putum eteyyo samat nii musuu kati mucoopoo. <verse eid="REV 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 12:16" />Pale etaam ya neeyankanan aal a, néepankin putum eteyyo neemelan musuu ma emma nínkinankoo ya néefulanii ma ti putum eteyyo. <verse eid="REV 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 12:17" />Nínkinankoo ya néeñiken meemak ti aal a, neeca eyitan hikam ti epuuk ya keetowiye ka pakati aal a, kéetuule ka púlooŋ <char style="w">hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti Pútuun pa nkacok piliit ti tooñaa eyya Yéesu náayisane ya. <verse eid="REV 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 12:18" />Nínkinankoo ya neesiiŋo ti kantant ka pukol kaatii ka.<verse eid="REV 12:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="REV 13" />
  <para style="s">Elúkuleen éefulii ti kaatii ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 13:1" />Fiye incuk élukuleen elampa ti éfulii ti kaatii ka. Neetaak usiin ŋaasuwan niŋ kikaw isak niŋ kúsupak niŋ éwuulu amansa ti kaasiin óo kaasiin eteyyo. Ti hikaw óo hikaw intaak caacaw citi kateñal Pútuun pa. <verse eid="REV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 13:2" />Elúkuleen eyya inci incuke ya neenakool nii esaamaay pale neetaak woot samat nii uti eyen elampa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eyen elampa eyya <char style="w">Saŋ</char> naaluwe ya le, eneetaat eyen pale “ours” (falans kaŋ) walla “bear” (ankale kaŋ). </char></note> niŋ putum samat nii piti cata. Nínkinankoo ya neewufan élukuleen ya sempe eteyyo niŋ <char style="w">elemeyu</char> eteyyo niŋ kayine kenfakat.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:3-6">Dañel 7:3-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 13:3" />Hikee ti kikaw ka kiti élukuleen ya nihicuk fiye nii hikuumeekuum fo hiket, pale maasontuwaay ma miti eket ya immifisak. Pakan paka púlooŋ nkaŋaŋo nkanapan élukuleen ya. <verse eid="REV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 13:4" />Nkákilipo hátikin nínkinankoo ya kamma neewufane sempe eteyyo élukuleen ya, nkákilipo lompo hátikin élukuleen ya, nkacakan: “Ayme acuke nii élukuleen eyye? Ayme afaayitan hikam teyyo?”<verse eid="REV 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 13:5" />Elúkuleen ya neewufanee sempe kati émakiyanoolo neeteñal Pútuun pa. Neewufanee lompo kati éhin héesuume yo fo kiim áwii ésupak niŋ kúsupak (42). <verse eid="REV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 13:6" />Néeyaañ kateñal Pútuun pa, neesok heenaput ti caacaw etempo, niŋ ékinuma etempo, ekina eyem, keekine ka alacana. <verse eid="REV 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 13:7" />Elúkuleen ya neewufanee sempe epikam pakan paka <char style="w">keesampanee ka pakati Pútuun pa</char> niŋ kati eheekii. Neewufanee sempe ti síi óo síi, pakan óo pakan, híleeluuf óo híleeluuf niŋ mah óo mah.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:8">Dañel 7:8</ref>,<ref loc="DAN 7:21">21</ref>,<ref loc="DAN 7:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 11:36">11:36</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 13:8" />Keekine ka púlooŋ ti etaam ya éfikakilipo hátikin élukuleen ya. Payenkuu kayem payenka ucawii weekiicutee wa ti púkoo ya eti eloŋ ya le niŋ <char style="w">púlunta pa</char> efipiliilee. Púkoo eyyuu eti Císaacii ca ceetaaŋee ca.<verse eid="REV 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 13:9" />An óo an eetaake kaanuu ásiitan! <verse eid="REV 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 13:10" />An óo an eeñaŋee hicoopuyee ti núkuluma, afaacoopee ti núkuluma. An óo an eeñaŋee himukuyee niŋ káakuntu, afaamukee niŋ káakuntu.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 15:2">Jeremiya 15:2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 43:11">43:11</ref></char></note> Ooto pakan paka keesampanee ka pakati Pútuun pa kañaŋaa kamukut, kañaŋut kayesan puson káyinan ka.<verse eid="REV 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elúkuleen éefulii ti etaam ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 13:11" />Eehuu hipimuus, incuk ekee élukuleen éefulii ti etaam ya. Neetaak usiin úsupak samat nii císaacii, pale néekup samat nii nínkinankoo. <verse eid="REV 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 13:12" />Neewen ti sempe sa púlooŋ siti élukuleen ya éyaañ ya ti caacaw eteyyo. Néehin etaam ya niŋ keekine ka teyyo kápikilipo hátikin élukuleen ya éyaañ ya, eyya maasontuwaay eteyyo miti eket ya meefisake ma. <verse eid="REV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 13:13" />Néehin píyisan penfakat, néehin fala seemak sípifulii patiila sípiwanoonii t’etaam hátikin pakan paka. <verse eid="REV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 13:14" />Neeyeno kaalincan pakan paka keekine ka ti etaam ya, pínapii ti píyisan empa neewufanee pa épihin ti caacaw élukuleen ya éyaañ ya. Neesokii kamemanool himuum heenakoole nii élukuleen ya eekuumee ya niŋ káakuntu ka háati fo neeloŋ. <verse eid="REV 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 13:15" />Elúkuleen ya ésupiyenu ya neewufanee sempe epuwufan esuuŋut himuum ha hiti élukuleen ya éyaañ ya, ancuk kati híkup. Himuum ha níhihin keepooke ka púlooŋ ékilipo hátikin eteeho kapumukee. <verse eid="REV 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 13:16" />Elúkuleen ya ésupiyenu ya, néehin lompo an óo an ti sempe apitaak lánkamaasi ti epeesoo yáali niŋ fotom ti éyitoo: pakan kenkilis niŋ keemaka, kusaanum niŋ keeleke, keeneetaat pimiikan niŋ pimiikan. <verse eid="REV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 13:17" />An átayini hinoom niŋ kaanooman, taamanta ataakut lánkamaasi ya eeyem ya caacaw ca citi élukuleen ya, niŋ fotom caacaw eteyyo fa incifinee fa. <verse eid="REV 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 13:18" />Eehe ecohato neecakane. An óo an éesuume kunuu áfaameyi caacaw élukuleen ya ti fa neefinee fa, kaatuko pafinal pa piti caacaw akee an. Pafinal pa piyem sikeme isak niŋ yoonool niŋ áwii éhaaciil niŋ isak niŋ yoonool (666).<verse eid="REV 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="REV 14" />
  <para style="s">Císaacii ca niŋ pakan paka síwuli keme niŋ áwii ésupak niŋ pakapaakiil paka (144,000)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 14:1" />Fiye insincan, incuk hátikinam Císaacii ca incisiiŋiye ti tíntiŋ ya eti <char style="w">Siyon</char> eeyem ya <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>, keeyeniye ka nenco kayem pakan paka síwuli keme niŋ áwii ésupak niŋ pakapaakiil paka (144,000) keetaake ka ti píyitii pakiical pa piti caacaw etenco niŋ caacaw ca citi Paapaa ateyoo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 9:4">Esekiyel 9:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 14:2" />Insí pasokal péefulii alacana samat nii pasapal penfakat piti kúsuu niŋ piti hileeŋ etiil. Pasokal empa inci ínsiye pa samat nii piti pisapa kóntiŋ keeyem ti hisapu kóntiŋ. <verse eid="REV 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 14:3" />Nkacook hícimu héeyeeni hátikin <char style="w">elemeyu</char> ya niŋ hátikin waah wa upaakiil wa weeyem wa kaloŋa niŋ ñíhampaatiin ña. An ayinaat káyipen hícimu ha fo niŋ neetaat pakan paka síwuli keme niŋ áwii ésupak niŋ pakapaakiil paka (144,000) keenoomee ka ti etaam ya. <verse eid="REV 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 14:4" />Payenkuu kayem kéemiit ka pakaal, nkáyemi keekuule. Nkanapan Císaacii ca pan óo pan pa incikaaye. Nkanoomee ti pakan paka nkawaaseenee Pútuun pa niŋ Císaacii ca samat nii pamaañal púcook. <verse eid="REV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 14:5" />Kataapala kacaam, kayinaatee kawatan.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEP 3:13">Sofoniya 3:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Simaleekoo sa síhaaciil sa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 14:6" />Fiye innene cuk ekee <char style="w">maleekoo</char> eeyeniye káyitu patiila, neetaak ekooŋan éesuume eepayantoo eti káatuunan pakan paka keekine ka ti etaam ya, ti mah óo mah, ti síi óo síi, ti híleeluuf óo híleeluuf niŋ ti pakan óo pakan. <verse eid="REV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 14:7" />Neesok niŋ hilim heeceeke: “Nife Pútuun pa innisayan nii pímakimaki, kamma caanak ca citi kíiti ya etempo pakan paka íncicolii. Níkilipo hátikin eeliile ya alacana, etaam ya, kaatii ka niŋ úpun wa.”<verse eid="REV 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 14:8" />Maleekoo ésupiyenu néenowii puson éyaañ ya neesok: “Anowaa! Babilon enfakat ya anowaa,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 21:9">Esayi 21:9</ref></char></note> ti casupoolat ca citeyoo naawufane písii pa púlooŋ piti <char style="w">púlunta pa</char> pipilaan elaan wiiñ ya eyya néhinii ya kápihin héesuumut Pútuun pa!”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:7-8">Jeremiya 51:7-8</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 14:9" />Maleekoo éhaaciyenu néenowii puson etempo neesok niŋ hilim heeceeke: “An óo an éekilipiye hátikin élukuleen ya niŋ himuum eteyyo eeha nkamemanoole ha, naataak lánkamaasi eteyyo ti éyitoo niŋ fotom ti epeesoo, <verse eid="REV 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 14:10" />oom an lompo áfaatunkee apilaan elaan wiiñ ya eti káñiken ka kiti Pútuun pa, eekaasee ya peeyayoolutee niŋ man ti elontoŋ ya eti káñiken etempo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 51:17">Esayi 51:17</ref></char></note> Afaakallanee niŋ seemak séeceeke<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24">Púcook 19:24</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 38:22">Esekiyel 38:22</ref></char></note> hátikin pumaleekoo pa peesampanee pa niŋ hátikin Císaacii ca. <verse eid="REV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 14:11" />Háaputa ha hiti ñíseeña ña ñiteyii efihisilo fo cancowiyaaw púley.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:10">Esayi 34:10</ref></char></note> Kéekilipiye ka hátikin élukuleen ya niŋ himuum eteyyo niŋ fotom an óo an eetaake lánkamaasi ya eti caacaw eteyyo, etikataak éyekunoolo hánant hanakan.” <verse eid="REV 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 14:12" />Ooto pakan paka <char style="w">keesampanee ka pakati Pútuun pa</char> kañaŋaa kamukut, poko kéetuule ka kilim etempo nkatowo nkáyinane ti Yéesu. <verse eid="REV 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 14:13" />Fiye ínsi hilim héefulii alacana heesoke: “Kiic eehe: kayihaayih keekete ka ti caacaw ca citi <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> písik fiye pikaay hátikin. <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> nkusok: Ee, éfikayekunoolo ti páhin pa piteyii penfakat pa, kaatuko páhinalii peenape pa efipinapanii.”<verse eid="REV 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaamaañ ka etaam ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 14:14" />Fiye insincan, incuk hátikinam káatiŋu keehiina, akee naayeno ti káatiŋu ka eenakoole nii <char style="w">Añii An</char>,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dañel 7:13</ref></char></note> éwuulu sanoo eti amansa neeyeno ti hikawoo niŋ káakaawuma keeliye ti epeesoo. <verse eid="REV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 14:15" />Ekee <char style="w">maleekoo</char> néefulii ti <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char>, neesokoo niŋ hilim heeceeke: “Coop káakaawuma ka kitii immaañ, kamma waati ya eti kaamaañ ka neecole, kaatuko pasukal pa piti etaam ya piyanaayan.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 3:13">Sowel 3:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 14:16" />Fiye eeyeniye ya ti káatiŋu ka naacoop káakaawuma ka naamaañ etaam ya púlooŋ.<verse eid="REV 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 14:17" />Ekee maleekoo néefulii ti ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa eeyem ya alacana, ekina lompo neeyekan káakaawuma keeliye. <verse eid="REV 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 14:18" />Ekee maleekoo lompo eeyem eti hikaw ha hiti seemak sa, néefulii ti taapuloo ya eeyem ya <char style="w">kaaciin</char> ka, neesok eeyekane ya káakaawuma ka keeliye ka niŋ hilim heeceeke: “Coop káakaawuma ka kitii keeliye ka immaañ úsis wiiñ ya uti etaam ya, kamma papukal wiiñ ya mpiyane.” <verse eid="REV 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 14:19" />Maleekoo ya neecoop káakaawuma eteyyo keeliye ka epimaañ wiiñ ya eti etaam ya, neewant yo ti ékaacuma wiiñ ya enfakat ya eti káñiken ka kiti Pútuun pa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 63:1-6">Esayi 63:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 1:15">Esampoolo 1:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 14:20" />Neekakalee ti ékaacuma wiiñ ya tíkitaaŋ saatee ya, hísim níhifulii ti ékaacuma ya hipitey fo sikilomeetal sikeme síhaaciil (300) ti pálaaŋ, páloos eteeho, niŋ efalinc enakiyaa lupo hikaw ha lamma efihicukee.<verse eid="REV 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="REV 15" />
  <para style="s">Simaleekoo isak niŋ súsupak siti hítaapanu isak niŋ súsupak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 15:1" />Fiye innene cuk alacana pikee píyisan penfakat péenimaam. <char style="w" lemma="Maleekoo">Simaleekoo</char> isak niŋ súsupak insiyekan hítaapanu ha isak niŋ súsupak sa, kaatuko hikina hiyem hikelan ha heeñaŋe ha écoopii pikelan káñiken ka kiti Pútuun pa. <verse eid="REV 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 15:2" />Incuk waah weecuke nii kaatii kiti weeloo upunakanoolo niŋ seemak. Keesiiŋiye ka pukol kaatii ka kayem keeheeke ka élukuleen ya niŋ himuum eteyyo heememanoolee ha niŋ pafinal caacaw eteyyo. Nkayekan púkontiŋ empa Pútuun pa mpuwufanii pa. <verse eid="REV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 15:3" />Nkayeno caacook hícimu ha hiti <char style="w">Móyiis</char>,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:1">Efúlii 15:1</ref></char></note> amiikan a ati Pútuun pa, niŋ hícimu ha hiti Císaacii ca, nkasok:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">“<char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> Pútuun pa piti sempe sa púlooŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">pawenali penfakat, apan mpíhin an apiŋaŋo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">Amansa ya ati <char style="w">púlunta pa</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">pítin pa pitii <char style="w" lemma="Pucoonool">peecoonoole</char> mpitempo!<verse eid="REV 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 15:4" />Ateeteyo, ayme atafeyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">náamakiyan caacawi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">Kaatuko awe lamayi yem eekuule,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">apan púlunta pa púlooŋ éfipikey mpíkilipo hátikini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">kaatuko páhinali peecoonoole pa píyisaneeyisan.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 10:7">Jeremiya 10:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 86:9">Kícimu 86:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 15:5" />Pamuusal eehuu insincan, incuk alacana <char style="w" lemma="Ekúut ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa">ékuut ya enfakat ya</char>, eeyekane ya sínankiin sa súsupak sa la <char style="w">písiyool</char> pa empa Pútuun pa mpiliile pa niŋ pakan etempo mpikiicee la,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 38:21">Efúlii 38:21</ref></char></note> néepankinee páhantuwa la sampanee la. <verse eid="REV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 15:6" />Simaleekoo isak niŋ súsupak sa seeyekane sa hítaapanu isak niŋ súsupak sa, ínsifulii la sampanee la. Insísoolo wañ weekuule nuumiñal, kaafaal kiti sanoo nkicenkee ti púsus etenso. <verse eid="REV 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 15:7" />Fiye ukee ti waah wa upaakiil wa weeyem wa kaloŋa nuuwufan simaleekoo sa isak niŋ súsupak sa sipool sanoo isak niŋ súsupak seemeeŋe niŋ káñiken ka kiti Pútuun pa, peeyem pa kaloŋa fo cancowiyaaw púley. <verse eid="REV 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 15:8" />La sampanee la inkoonool niŋ háaputa héefulii ti hamake niŋ sempe sa siti Pútuun pa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 40:34-35">Efúlii 40:34-35</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 8:10-11">1 Pumansa 8:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 6:4">Esayi 6:4</ref></char></note> An ayinaat pinako la sampanee la fo ta hítaapanu ha isak niŋ súsupak sa hiti simaleekoo sa isak niŋ súsupak sa nihipaye ta.<verse eid="REV 15:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="REV 16" />
  <para style="s">Sipool sa isak niŋ súsupak sa siti káñiken ka kiti Pútuun pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 16:1" />Púful toko, ínsi hilim heeceeke héefulii la sampanee la nihisok <char style="w" lemma="Maleekoo">simaleekoo</char> sa isak niŋ súsupak sa: “Nikaay caniniis ti etaam ya sipool sa isak niŋ súsupak sa siti káñiken ka kiti Pútuun pa.”<verse eid="REV 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 16:2" />Maleekoo ya éyaañ ya neekaay neeniis epool eteyyo ti etaam ya. Musontuwaay méecintanana immiseeñ<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 9:10">Efúlii 9:10</ref></char></note> úmmuwuhalii ti keetaake ka lánkamaasi ya eti élukuleen elampa ya niŋ kéekilipiye ka hátikin himuum eteyyo eeha nkamemanoole ha.<verse eid="REV 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 16:3" />Maleekoo ya ésupiyenu ya neeniis epool eteyyo ti kaatii ka. Kaatii ka nkiyeso hísim, samat nii hiti an eekete, waah óo waah weeyem kaloŋa ti kaatii ka nuuket.<verse eid="REV 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 16:4" />Maleekoo ya éhaaciyenu ya neeniis epool eteyyo ti úpun wa niŋ la taakale la man meeneena, immiyeso hísim.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 7:17-21">Efúlii 7:17-21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 16:5" />Fiye ínsi maleekoo ya eetaake ya sempe ti man ma neesoke Pútuun pa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:5">“Awe <char style="w" lemma="Pucoonool">eecoonoole</char> ti páhinal kíiti eyye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:5">O Eekuule ya, awe eeyem ya, niŋ eetaakiye ya hínum.<verse eid="REV 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 16:6" />Kamma pakan paka nkaniise hísim ha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:6">hiti <char style="w" lemma="Keesampanee ka pakati Pútuun pa">keesampanee ka</char> niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Ayaamakoola">piyaamakoola</char> pa pakatii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:6">ekina ewune allaananii hísim</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:6">samat nii fa nkañaŋe fa.”<verse eid="REV 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 16:7" />Fiye ínsi hilim héefulii ti taapuloo ya eeyem ya <char style="w">kaaciin</char> ka, nihisok:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:7">“Ee, <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> Pútuun pa piti sempe sa púlooŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:7">páhinali kíiti peecoonoole mpitempo.”<verse eid="REV 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 16:8" />Maleekoo ya épaakiilenu ya neeniis epool eteyyo ti caanak ca, caanak ca inciwufanee sempe siti hisowu pakan paka niŋ pasowe etenco. <verse eid="REV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 16:9" />Pakan paka nkasowo niŋ pasowe pa penfakat pa, nkateñal caacaw ca citi Pútuun pa, peetaake pa sempe siti éwananii hítaapanu eehuu púlooŋ ti pakan, pale nkapook púwunko umuuyen wa uteyii kapisayan nii pímakimaki.<verse eid="REV 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 16:10" />Maleekoo ya ésakiyenu ya neeniis epool eteyyo ti <char style="w">elemeyu</char> ya eti élukuleen elampa ya, cáwii eteyyo incimeeŋ niŋ énimaan.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 10:21-22">Efúlii 10:21-22</ref></char></note> Pakan paka nkayeno kalumal kíleeluufuyii kamma ñíseeña. <verse eid="REV 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 16:11" />Nkateñal Pútuun pa piti alacana kamma ñíseeña ña ñiteyii niŋ musontuwaay ma miteyii, apan nkapook púwunko heenaput eeha nkáhine ha.<verse eid="REV 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 16:12" />Maleekoo ya eewase ya isak niŋ yoonool neeniis epool eteyyo ti musuu ma menfakat ma miti Efalat. Man etemmo ummusooŋ, mupuwañal pítin pa piti pumansa pa keekaakaay ka éfulii pa caanak ca íncifulii pa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:15">Esayi 11:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 16:13" />Fiye incuk <char style="w" lemma="Seetaani">siseetaani</char> síhaaciil seecuke nii puhoon. Insífulii ti putum nínkinankoo ya, ti putum élukuleen elampa ya niŋ ti putum ayaamakoola ya eeneetaat a pánipani. <verse eid="REV 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 16:14" />Aŋuu <char style="w" lemma="Hísaalumant">kísaalumant</char> kiti piseetaani keeyem ti páhin píyisan, nkikaay pati pumansa pa pakati <char style="w">púlunta pa</char> púlooŋ kupuconcenoolii kiti hikam ha hiti hinoom ha henfakat ha hiti Pútuun pa piti sempe sa púlooŋ.<verse eid="REV 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 16:15" />Ateeteyo asok: “Nísiitan, Inci fákey samat nii álipa! Ayihaayih eetowiye ya ti kaasincan náasoolo, ancuk timpi akaay ñáfalfali naasuu.”<verse eid="REV 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 16:16" />Fiye, piseetaani pa mpuconcoolan pumansa pa nantoonool la nkasok “Aamaketon” ti kaŋ ya eti <char style="w" lemma="Ahiburu">Hiburu</char>.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 5:19">Pifiita kilim 5:19</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 23:29">2 Pumansa 23:29</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 16:17" />Ta eehuu nihimuuse ta, maleekoo ya eewase ya isak niŋ súsupak neeniis epool eteyyo ti eyam ya. Hilim heeceeke níhifulii la sampanee la, nihisok: “Fiye payaapa!” <verse eid="REV 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 16:18" />Intaako pamaliñoolal, pahampanane niŋ pasapal etiil, etaam ya lompo néeyiyiŋan niŋ sempe. Páyiyiŋanal etaam empuu pitaapala pitaako emma an naaliilee. <verse eid="REV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 16:19" />Ti oom páyiyiŋanal, saatee ya enfakat ya néepaacinoolo ñáhaaciil, pisaatee pa piti etaam ya púlooŋ mpúpucaloolee. Pútuun pa mpínawuno umuuyen wa uti Babilon enfakat ya. Mpútunkoo apilaan elontoŋ ya eti elaan wiiñ ya eti káñiken etempo kenfakat ka.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 51:17">Esayi 51:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 16:20" />Pucon pa púlooŋ mpuhootanee, an ayinaat hicuku pítintiŋ pa. <verse eid="REV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 16:21" />Etiil eti pitaali penfakat néefulii patiila, etiil eyyuu neecuk nii pukumpul peetaake sikilo áwii ésupak,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 9:23-24">Efúlii 9:23-24</ref></char></note> mpúnowalii ti pakan paka. Pakan paka nkateñal Pútuun pa kamma hítaapanu pitaali pa, kaatuko hítaapanu ha hifomaafom fo muus.<verse eid="REV 16:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="REV 17" />
  <para style="s">Babilon, aal a ahaañiya ya enfakat a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 17:1" />Ta eehuu nihipaye ta, ekee ti <char style="w" lemma="Maleekoo">simaleekoo</char> sa isak niŋ súsupak sa seeyekane sa sipool sa isak niŋ súsupak sa néekey ti inci neesokam: “Kéy, inci píyisani fa aal a ahaañiya ya enfakat a, eetaake ya sempe ti hícump musuu, fa afaasiiŋanee fa ti pisiya. <verse eid="REV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 17:2" />Pumansa pa pakati etaam ya nkahinto neyoo, pakan paka lompo nkalaan elaan wiiñ ya eti casupoolat ca citeyoo fo kákuman.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:7">Jeremiya 51:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 23:17">Esayi 23:17</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 17:3" />Púful toko, <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> nkúwanoonii ti inci, maleekoo ya neecoopam ti <char style="w" lemma="Káahaaŋ ka tes">káahaaŋ tes</char>. Toko incuk aal a naayeniye ti élukuleen elampa éecunke neetaak kikaw isak niŋ kúsupak niŋ usiin ŋaasuwan, ucaw uti kateñal Pútuun pa nuukiicee lan óo lan ti enii eteyyo. <verse eid="REV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 17:4" />Aal a náasoolo wañ wéecunke weenape núuciiti hinoom, náasankaloolo niŋ pisanoo niŋ pumaan niŋ mínankiin méeciita hinoom. Naayekan ti epeesoo elontoŋ eti sanoo, neemeeŋ hícump waah weekuulut niŋ waah uti meeñeya uti casupoolat ca citeyoo. <verse eid="REV 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 17:5" />Caacaw ence cikiicee ti éyitoo, caacaw enca ammeya nii, káacenkin etenco kiyoleeyol:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 17:5" />
  <para style="pc" vid="REV 17:5">“Babilon enfakat ya,</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="REV 17:5">Iññáa ya ati pakaal paka pihaañiya pa</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="REV 17:5">niŋ waah óo waah uti meeñeya uti etaam ya.”<verse eid="REV 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 17:6" />Inci incuk nii aal a éekumane, kaatuko alaanaalaan hísim ha hiti pakan paka <char style="w">keesampanee ka pakati Pútuun pa</char>, keemukee ka kamma nkáyinane ti Yéesu nkakaman kiteyoo. Ta incukoo ta iŋŋaŋo meemak.<verse eid="REV 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 17:7" />Fiye maleekoo ya neesokam: “Weyme uwune aŋŋaŋo? Inci fáhini áapimeyi keeyolee ka kiti aal a niŋ élukuleen elampa ya eyya naalapiye ya teyyo, eetaake ya kikaw isak niŋ kúsupak niŋ usiin ŋaasuwan. <verse eid="REV 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 17:8" />Elúkuleen ya eyya ancuke ya, etaakaataako hínum, pale fiye eneetaat. Eféefulii ti kaayeen ka keetaakut ka pilehu néepucaloolee. Keeyem ka ti etaam ya efikaŋaŋo nkacukaa élukuleen ya, poko kayem payenka ucawii weekiicutee wa ti púkoo ya eti eloŋ ya kápiliŋ ta <char style="w">púlunta pa</char> mpiliilee. Payenkuu efikaŋaŋo nkacukaa élukuleen ya kamma neetaakiye hínum, fiye eneetaat pale éfeeñohoonii.<verse eid="REV 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 17:9" />“Eehe hicakanaacakan kunuu niŋ ecohato. Kikaw ka isak niŋ kúsupak ka kiyem sítintiŋ isak niŋ súsupak la aal a naayeniye la kayen. Kikaw enkuu lompo pumansa isak niŋ pákasupak. <verse eid="REV 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 17:10" />Intaako teyii isak keekete, oonool oopa ti <char style="w">elemeyu</char> ya, akee ya aloot ákey. Pale niŋ ákeyyoo atafiyo ti elemeyu ya. <verse eid="REV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 17:11" />Elúkuleen ya eetaakiye ya hínum pale fiye eneetaat, ekina faŋ eteyyo akee amansa. Akina akee ti pumansa pa isak niŋ pákasupak paka, apan náayemi lompo eewase ya isak niŋ pákahaaciil, áfaapucaloolee. <verse eid="REV 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 17:12" />Usiin wa ŋaasuwan wa ewwa ancuke wa, ukina lompo pumansa ŋaasuwan,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:24">Dañel 7:24</ref></char></note> apan cáwii ca citeyii ciloot cíyaañ. Pale efikataak sempe siti éyenoonii pumansa ti coonool niŋ élukuleen ya fo waati yoonool. <verse eid="REV 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 17:13" />Pumansa pa payenkuu, hoonool lamma hiyem teyii, hikina hiyem kawufan élukuleen ya sempe sa siteyii niŋ kayine ka kiteyii. <verse eid="REV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 17:14" />Efikakam Císaacii ca, pale Císaacii ca eficiheekii, kamma inciyem Ahámpaatiin a ati ñíhampaatiin ña niŋ lompo Amansa ya ati pumansa pa. Pakanoo payenka naayonkale ka naamamal nkátuuloo, efikayeno neyoo.”<verse eid="REV 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 17:15" />Maleekoo ya nene esokam: “Eeha ancuke ha, heeyem ha hícump musuu emma aal a ahaañiya ya naataake ma temmo sempe, mikina miyem hícump mah, pakan, písii niŋ kíleeluuf. <verse eid="REV 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 17:16" />Elúkuleen ya efeenat aal a ahaañiya ya, usiin wa ŋaasuwan wa lompo ewwa ancuke wa efuunatoo. Efikalamal waah wa uteyoo púlooŋ nkawaatoo ñáfalfali. Efikali kihaayoo nkasow keetowiye ka. <verse eid="REV 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 17:17" />Kaatuko Pútuun pa puwase ti saanii eeha mpílafiye ha íhinu ancuk kati káhin ho. Efíkasiyool nkacoop sempe sa siti cáwii ca citeyii kapuwufan so élukuleen ya, fo ta kilim enka Pútuun pa mpusoke ka efikitaako. <verse eid="REV 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 17:18" />Aal a aŋa ancuke ya, akina ayem saatee ya enfakat ya eetaake ya sempe ti pumansa pa pakati etaam ya.”<verse eid="REV 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="REV 18" />
  <para style="s">Enow ya eti saatee ya enfakat ya eti Babilon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 18:1" />Eehuu hipimuus, incuk ekee <char style="w">maleekoo</char> éefulii alacana épuwanoonii. Neetaak sempe senfakat, hamake eteyyo nihicaaŋan etaam ya. <verse eid="REV 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 18:2" />Neeceek meemak neesok:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:2">“Anowaa! Babilon enfakat ya anowaa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:2">Ayénooniyoo ékinuma <char style="w" lemma="Seetaani">piseetaani</char> niŋ <char style="w">hísaalumant</char> óo hísaalumant,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:2">niŋ eti pusuwa óo pusuwa peekuulut mpupookee.<verse eid="REV 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 18:3" />Kaatuko ti casupoolat ca citeyoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:3">naawufane písii pa púlooŋ piti <char style="w">púlunta pa</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:3">pipilaan elaan wiiñ ya eyya néhinii ya kápihin héesuumut Pútuun pa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:3">Pumansa pa pakati etaam ya nkahinto neyoo hínum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:3">punoomana pa keeyem ka ti etaam ya nkayeno kusaanum</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:3">ti hisaanumate ha hiteyoo henfakat ha hiti pahaaño pa.”<verse eid="REV 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 18:4" />Fiye, innene sí hikee hilim héefulii alacana nihisok:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:4">“Aluu pakanam, nílaaŋool neyoo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">Ancuk etinitaak himpaac ti umuuyen wa uteyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">etinitaak lompo himpaac ti hícump hítaapanu ha heekaakaayoo ha pitaako.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 48:20">Esayi 48:20</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:8">Jeremiya 50:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:6">51:6</ref>,<ref loc="JER 51:45">45</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 18:5" />Kaatuko umuuyen wa uteyoo unaŋanoolaa-naŋanoolo fo patiila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:5">apan Pútuun pa pifiilut páhinaloo peenaput pa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:20-21">Púcook 18:20-21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:9">Jeremiya 51:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 18:6" />Níhinoo samat nii fa náahine fa pakakee paka.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">Nicooyoo fo ñésupak heenaput eeha náahine ha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:6">Elaan wiiñ ya eefete ya eyya naawufane ya pakakee paka kapilaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">nimeeŋan elontoŋ ya eteyoo fo ñésupak kati alaan.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 137:8">Kícimu 137:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:29">Jeremiya 50:29</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 18:7" />Níhinoo apucuk kúnuul niŋ esampoolo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">ancuk esampoolo ya eteyoo elehaa niŋ fa náamakiyanooliye fa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">kúnuul ka kiteyoo nkileh lompo niŋ hisaanumate ha hiteyoo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">Kaatuko asokaasok ti yaanoo:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">'Inci oopa le nii aal amansa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">inci neetaat eyaaŋat aŋa áyiinoo eekete, apan etisampoolo háati poonool.'<verse eid="REV 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 18:8" />Ekina ewune hícump hítaapanu waah ewwe nuumankee kamma akina:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">eket, esampoolo niŋ épankul.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:8">Enkuu púlooŋ efikilaakiyoo ti hinoom hoonool,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">seemak sa insisowoo fo aleem motic.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:8">Kaatuko <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> Pútuun pa péehinoo pa kíiti pitaakaataak sempe.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 47:7-9">Esayi 47:7-9</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 18:9" />“Pumansa pa púlooŋ ti etaam ya keehintiye ka neyoo, apan nkali ti hisaanumate ha hiteyoo, efikakooŋ nkasampoolo kiteyoo, nkacukaa háaputa ha hiti kaaleemanee ka kiteyoo. <verse eid="REV 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 18:10" />Efikasiiŋo pílaaŋ nkafe kamma kúnuul ka kenfakat enka naayem ka ti hicuku, nkasok:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:10">'Owó, ketaa ti hikaw! Owó, ketaa ti hikaw!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:10">Awe saatee ya enfakat ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:10">Babilon, saatee ya eetaake ya sempe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:10">ti waati yoonool lamma Pútuun pa mpíhinuu kíiti!'<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 26:16-17">Esekiyel 26:16-17</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 18:11" />“Punoomana pa lompo pakati etaam ya efikakooŋ, nkasampoolo kamma akina, kaatuko an nene anoomut panoomanal pa piteyii. <verse eid="REV 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 18:12" />Oom panoomanal piyem: pisanoo niŋ púkotifoloo, pumaan niŋ mínankiin méeciita hinoom, pupaŋ peewalla niŋ pupaŋ peewiina, wañ wéecunke weenape núuciiti hinoom, niŋ papaloo óo papaloo éesuume haaw, waah óo waah weememanoolee niŋ úŋiiŋ eñaap, waah óo waah weememanoolee niŋ pupapaloo péeciita hitaaku, mañ óo mañ emma ímmiyeluŋanee, niŋ pínankiin peewalla. <verse eid="REV 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 18:13" />Panoomanal pa lompo piyem pahatal péesuume haaw, típaapikeen, caminkoloŋ óo caminkoloŋ, munucu méesuume haaw, elaan, lúuliin eti olif, efol, paasiit, síis, písaacii, pufalinc, pisaleet, pimiikan, niŋ keecokee ti hikam.<verse eid="REV 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 18:14" />“Punoomana pa efikasok saatee ya eti Babilon:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:14">'Waah wa weenape wa ewwa ankiipe wa hitaaku ufakuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:14">páwalliyanoolal pa pitii púlooŋ lompo pícimaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:14">aatinene cuk po!'<verse eid="REV 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 18:15" />“Punoomana pa keenoomane ka ti saatee eyyuu fo káyenoonii kusaanum, efikasiiŋo pílaaŋ kamma nkafeye kúnuul ka kenfakat enka neeyem ka ti hicuku. Efikakooŋ nkasampoolo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 27">Esekiyel 27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 18:16" />Nkasok:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:16">'Owó, ketaa ti hikaw! Owó, ketaa ti hikaw!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:16">Awe saatee ya enfakat ya!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:16">Aásoolaasoolo wañ weewalla, niŋ wañ wéecunke weenape núuciiti hinoom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:16">ínsankaloolo niŋ pisanoo, pumaan niŋ mínankiin méeciita hinoom.<verse eid="REV 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 18:17" />Ti waati yoonool lamma hitaaku ha hitii púlooŋ níhipucaloolee!'</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 18:17">“Pinama pa púlooŋ pakati ñiteen ña ñenfakat ña, niŋ payenka nkáhin ka teñño niŋ payenka nkáyuukale ka, niŋ an óo an aŋa páhin pa piteyoo mpiyem ti kaatii, poko púlooŋ efikasiiŋo pílaaŋ. <verse eid="REV 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 18:18" />Niŋ kacukaa háaputa ha hiti pusowo pa piti saatee ya, nkaceek meemak nkasok: 'Eyyeyme saatee ecuke nii saatee enfakat eyye?' <verse eid="REV 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 18:19" />Nkahoholan esiya ti kikawii kápiyisan páciite pa piteyii, nkakooŋ nkasampoolo, nkaceek meemak nkasok:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:19">'Owó, ketaa ti hikaw! Owó, ketaa ti hikaw!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:19">Awe saatee ya enfakat ya!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:19">Hitaaku ha púlooŋ hiti pakati ñiteen ña ñenfakat ña ñiti kaatii ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:19">ti hisaanumate ha hitii níhifulii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:19">Ti waati yoonool lamma, ímpucaloolee.'<verse eid="REV 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 18:20" />Pale nitaak pásuuma, aluu keekine ka alacana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:20">kaatuko saatee ya épucaloolee!<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:48">Jeremiya 51:48</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:20">Nitaak pásuuma, aluu <char style="w">keesampanee ka pakati Pútuun pa</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:20">
    <char style="w" lemma="Apoñapoñ">pupoñapoñ</char> pa niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Ayaamakoola">piyaamakoola</char> pa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:20">Kaatuko Pútuun pa píhinaahin yo kíiti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:20">mpinaŋ teyyo hítaapanu ha eeha neenaŋe ha ti aluu.”<verse eid="REV 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 18:21" />Fiye, ekee maleekoo eti sempe neecoop énankiin enfakat, eenapa líŋ, neewant yo ti kaatii ka, neesok:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:21">“Awe lompo, Babilon saatee ya enfakat ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:21">fiyuu aafawantee fíl niŋ sempe, apan an atanene acuki.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:63-64">Jeremiya 51:63-64</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 18:22" />An atanene ási lati awe an ti hisapu kóntiŋ niŋ ti caacook,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:22">ti hisapu kampiip, niŋ fotom kámpiis.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:22">Ahína óo áhina eesuusa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:22">an atanene acukii lati awe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:22">Pátuumal ésiken,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:22">an atanene ási po lati awe.<verse eid="REV 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 18:23" />Lampi etinene ecaaŋanee lati awe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:23">Hicenku pinimo niŋ fotom esa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:23">an atanene ásiyii lati awe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:23">Kaatuko punoomana pa pakatii kayeniye hínum keemaka ka ti etaam ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:23">illincan písii pa púlooŋ niŋ kaasaay ka kitii.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 24:8">Esayi 24:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:34">Jeremiya 7:34</ref>; <ref loc="JER 25:10">25:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 26:13">Esekiyel 26:13</ref>,<ref loc="EZK 26:21">21</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 18:24" />Hísim ha hiti piyaamakoola pa hicukeecuk lati awe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:24">niŋ hiti keesampanee ka pakati Pútuun pa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:24">niŋ hiti pakan paka púlooŋ keemukee ka ti etaam ya.”<verse eid="REV 18:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="REV 19" />
  <para style="s">Pásuuma peeyem alacana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 19:1" />Eehuu hipimuus, ínsi pahampanane patiila peecuke nii kilim kiti hícump pakan keeyeniye hiceeku kapusok:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:1">“Haleluya!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:1">Pútuun pa piti unaa pitaakaataak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:1">kafakan niŋ hamake niŋ sempe!<verse eid="REV 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 19:2" />Páhinal etempo kíiti <char style="w" lemma="Pucoonool">peecoonoole</char> mpitempo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:2">Kaatuko pisiiŋanaa-siiŋan ti pisiya aal a ahaañiya ya enfakat a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:2">eelecatane ya etaam ya ti casupoolat ca citeyoo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:2">Pútuun pa mpúnukan teyoo hísim ha hiti pimiikan etempo.”<verse eid="REV 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 19:3" />Kilim ka nene kiceek:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:3">“Haleluya!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:3">Háaputa ha héefulii ha teyoo nihisilo patiila fo cancowiyaaw púley.”<verse eid="REV 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 19:4" />Ñíhampaatiin ña áwii niŋ pakapaakiil paka niŋ waah wa upaakiil wa weeyem wa kaloŋa, nkákilipo nkámul Pútuun pa peeyeniye pa ti <char style="w">elemeyu</char> ya, nkaceek:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:4">“Amíini! Haleluya!”<verse eid="REV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 19:5" />Púful toko, hilim níhifulii ti elemeyu ya nihisok:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:5">“Ninimpan Pútuun pa piti unaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:5">aluu pimiikan etempo púlooŋ keefeye po ka,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 135:1">Kícimu 135:1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:5">kenfakat ka niŋ kenkilis ka!”<verse eid="REV 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 19:6" />Insí pahampanane peecuke nii kilim kiti hícump pakan, samat nii kúsuu kenfakat kiti kaatii niŋ pasapal etiil piti sempe.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:24">Esekiyel 1:24</ref></char></note> Kilim ka nkusok:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:6">“Haleluya!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:6">Kaatuko <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> Pútuun pa piti unaa piti sempe sa púlooŋ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:6">píyaañaa piyeno Amansa ya.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 97:1">Kícimu 97:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 99:1">99:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 19:7" />Uŋaañaayaa! Utaakaa pásuuma núumulaa po!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:7">Kaatuko pahaaño pa piti esa ya eti Císaacii ca púcoliyoocol,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:7">apan maañoo ya ateyoo naamemanoolo.<verse eid="REV 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 19:8" />Nkawufanoo epaŋ eewalla ápusoolo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:8">epaŋ eemiñale neekuul naat.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 19:8">(Epaŋ ya eewalla ya eyem páhinal pa peenape pa piti <char style="w">keesampanee ka pakati Pútuun pa</char>.)<verse eid="REV 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 19:9" />Fiye <char style="w">maleekoo</char> ya neesokam: “Kiic eehe: Kayihaayih keeyonkalee ka hili káciim ka kiti esa ya eti Císaacii ca!” Nene esokam: “Enkuu kiyem kilim ka kiti pánipani ya kiti Pútuun pa.”<verse eid="REV 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 19:10" />Ta maleekoo ya neepaye ta káakup, ínkilipo ti woot eteyyo púmul yo. Pale neesokam: “Ñaa, timpi hín eehuu! Inci lompo amiikan samat nii awe niŋ pakani ti káyinan keecoke ka tooñaa eyya Yéesu naasoke ya. Kílipo hátikin Pútuun pa! Tooñaa ya eyya Yéesu naasoke ya, ekina nétunk <char style="w" lemma="Ayaamakoola">piyaamakoola</char> pa káputuunan <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char>.”<verse eid="REV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eelapiye ya ti efalinc ya eehiina ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 19:11" />Fiye, incuk alacana néepankiniye,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:1">Esekiyel 1:1</ref> </char></note> efalinc eehiina néefulii. Aŋa eelapiye ya teyyo caacawoo Eehintiyee niŋ Páni. Náhinhin kíiti <char style="w">pucoonool,</char> naakam pucoonool.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 96:13">Kícimu 96:13</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 11:4">Esayi 11:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 19:12" />Ñíkinoo iññicaaŋ samat nii kaaleew seemak, náawuulo hícump púwuulu piti amansa. Nkakiic teyoo caacaw enca an náamiit, fo akina lamma ameya co. <verse eid="REV 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 19:13" />Náasoolo hísool héepuucee ti hísim. Caacawoo <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char>. <verse eid="REV 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 19:14" />Uyoŋ pusoocaali pakati alacana nuunapanoo. Nkásoolo pipaŋ peehiina mpúwalli mpukuul naat. Nkalapo ti pufalinc peehiina. <verse eid="REV 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 19:15" />Epaay eeliye néefulii ti putumoo, neyyo afaalaako písii pa. Afáatintiŋanii niŋ hikasap hiti mañ,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:9">Kícimu 2:9</ref></char></note> náayisan káñiken ka kenfakat ka kiti Pútuun pa piti sempe sa púlooŋ ti kakakal ti ékaacuma elaan wiiñ ya. <verse eid="REV 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 19:16" />Ti hísool ha hiteyoo niŋ ti hipoŋoo caacaw ence cikiicee: “Amansa ya ati pumansa pa niŋ Ahámpaatiin a ati ñíhampaatiin ña.”<verse eid="REV 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 19:17" />Púful toko, incuk ekee <char style="w">maleekoo</char> eesiiŋiye ti caanak ca. Neeceek meemak ti pusuwa pa empa mpíyit pa patiila, neesok: “Níkey niconcoolo nipili káciim ka kenfakat ka kiti Pútuun pa! <verse eid="REV 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 19:18" />Níkey nili kihaay pumansa pa, kihaay pusoocaali pa niŋ ñíhampaatiin ña pakateyii, kihaay pufalinc pa niŋ piteteyana etempo, niŋ kihaay pakan paka púlooŋ, kenkilis ka niŋ kenfakat ka, pimiikan pa niŋ keeneetaat ka pimiikan.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 39:17-20">Esekiyel 39:17-20</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 19:19" />Fiye, incuk élukuleen elampa ya, niŋ pumansa pa pakati <char style="w">púlunta pa</char> niŋ uyoŋ wa uti pusoocaali pa pakateyii, nkaconcooliye kati kakam niŋ eelapiye ya ti efalinc ya niŋ uyoŋ wa uti pusoocaali pa pakateyoo. <verse eid="REV 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 19:20" />Elúkuleen ya neecokee, niŋ <char style="w">ayaamakoola</char> ya eeneetaat a pánipani aŋa náhin ya píyisan apilincan keetaake ka lánkamaasi ya eti élukuleen ya, payenka nkákilipo ka hátikin himuum eteyyo eeha nkamemanoole ha. Poko t’ésupakii nkawantee kaloŋa ti han ha hiti seemak sa séeceeke sa. <verse eid="REV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 19:21" />Keetowiye ka nkamukee niŋ epaay ya éefulii ya ti putum eelapiye ya ti efalinc ya, pusuwa pa púlooŋ mpili kihaayii fo pisiit tuk.<verse eid="REV 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="REV 20" />
  <para style="s">Sitiil wúli ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 20:1" />Púful toko, incuk <char style="w">maleekoo</char> éefulii alacana épuwanoonii. Neetaak ékululuma ya eti kaayeen ka keetaakut ka pilehu, neeyekan ti epees eteyyo niseel nenfakat. <verse eid="REV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 20:2" />Neecok nínkinankoo ya, eeyem ya epululoola ya étuuta ya, néeyemi lompo <char style="w">Seetaani ya</char>, caacaw eteyyo lompo Akamool a, neecenk yo fo sitiil wúli. <verse eid="REV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 20:3" />Neewant yo ti kaayeen ka, neekul ko niŋ ékululuma, neemincan putum pa tíkitaaŋ, ancuk nínkinankoo ya etinene éyini kaalincan pakan paka fo ta sitiil sa wúli ya efisipa ta. Niŋ eehuu himuusaa, efeekatanee pale ti waati eetama.<verse eid="REV 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 20:4" />Púful toko, incuk pilemeyu,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:9">Dañel 7:9</ref></char></note> keeyeniye ka tempo kayem keewufanee ka kayine kiti íhinu kíiti. Incuk lompo saan sa siti payenka nkafiite ka kikawii kamma nkasoke kiti Yéesu, niŋ fa nkátuunane fa <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char>. Kákilipiit hátikin élukuleen ya niŋ fotom himuum eteyyo heememanoolee ha, kataakut lompo lánkamaasi eteyyo ti píyitii niŋ fotom ti sipeesii. Nkáyenoonii kaloŋa, nkayeno ti himansate ha niŋ <char style="w">Eenucee ya</char> fo sitiil wúli. <verse eid="REV 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 20:5" />Aŋe eyem pilito pa píyaañ pa ti eket ya. (Pakakee paka keekete ka káñohooniyoot ti eloŋ, fo ta sitiil sa wúli ya insipaye ta.) <verse eid="REV 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 20:6" />Kayihaayih, kéelitaniyee ka ti pilito pa píyaañ pa. Poko <char style="w">keesampanee ka pakati Pútuun pa</char>! Eket ya ésupiyenu ya éteyini teyii waah. Efikayeno <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">puwaaseena pakati Pútuun pa</char> niŋ pakati Eenucee ya, apan poko niŋ Eenucee ya efikayeno pumansa fo sitiil wúli.<verse eid="REV 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ihínuyee ha kíiti Seetaani ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 20:7" />Niŋ sitiil sa wúli ya sipayaa, <char style="w">Seetaani</char> ya éfeefulaniyee ti núkuluma. <verse eid="REV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 20:8" />Neekaay kati elincan písii pa púlooŋ peeyem pa ti sitonkoŋ sa sipaakiil sa siti etaam ya, oom písii piyem Gog niŋ Magog.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 38:1-23">Esekiyel 38:1-23</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 39:1-22">39:1-22</ref></char></note> Efeeconcenoolii kati kakaay hikam, apan nkameeŋ samat nii esiya ya eti kaatii ka. <verse eid="REV 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 20:9" />Nkafiitan etaam ya púlooŋ, nkákinkool pikin pa piti <char style="w">keesampanee ka pakati Pútuun pa</char>, saatee ya eyya Pútuun pa mpílafiye ya. Pale seemak ínsifulii patiila sipisowanii fo kaleem motic. <verse eid="REV 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 20:10" />Fiye Seetaani ya eelincanii ya, neewantee ti han ha hiti seemak sa séeceeke sa, la élukuleen elampa ya niŋ ayaamakoola ya eeneetaat a pánipani nkawantee la. Efikakallanee hánant hanakan fo cancowiyaaw púley.<verse eid="REV 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ihínuyee ha kíiti keekete ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 20:11" />Púful toko, incuk <char style="w">elemeyu</char> eehiina enfakat niŋ eeyeniye ya teyyo. Patiila niŋ t’etaam nkatey kápuful hátikinoo, nene kacukutee. <verse eid="REV 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 20:12" />Incuk keekete ka, kenfakat ka niŋ kenkilis ka, nkasiiŋiye hátikin elemeyu ya, púpukoo mpípankinee la Pútuun pa mpikiice la eeha púlooŋ pakan paka nkáhine ha. Ekee púkoo néepankinee, ekina eyem púkoo ya eti eloŋ ya. Keekete ka nkáhinee kíiti ti eeha nkáhine ha heekiicee ha ti púpukoo pa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:9-10">Dañel 7:9-10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 20:13" />Kaatii ka nkúfulanii keekete ka keeyeniye ka tenko. Eket ya niŋ cáwii ca citi keekete ka, nkáfulanii lompo keekete ka keeyeniye ka teyii, an óo an náahinee kíiti ti eeha náahine ha. <verse eid="REV 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 20:14" />Eket ya niŋ cáwii ca citi keekete ka nkawantee ti han ha hiti seemak sa. Han ha hiti seemak sa eehuu hiyem eket ya ésupiyenu ya. <verse eid="REV 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 20:15" />An óo an aŋa caacawoo ceekiicutee ti púkoo ya eti eloŋ ya awanteewant ti han ha hiti seemak sa.<verse eid="REV 20:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="REV 21" />
  <para style="s">Patiila éeyeeni niŋ t’etaam éeyeeni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 21:1" />Púful toko, incuk patiila éeyeeni niŋ t’etaam éeyeeni, kaatuko patiila ya eemaamane ya niŋ t’etaam ya eemaamane ya kamuusaamuus, kaatii nene kitaakiit.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:17">Esayi 65:17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 66:22">66:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 21:2" />Incuk Saatee ya eesampanee ya, eeyem ya <char style="w">Jerusalem</char> éeyeeni ya, néewanoonii épufulii alacana pati Pútuun pa. Neememanoolee épuwalli samat nii amaañoo éesooliye pikaayu pati áyiinoo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:1">Esayi 52:1</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 61:10">61:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 21:3" />Insí hilim heeceeke héefulii ti <char style="w">elemeyu</char> ya, nihisok: “Nisincan! Ekínuma ya eti Pútuun pa efeeyeno fiye silaŋ niŋ pakan paka, mpikin neyii. Nkayeno pakan etempo, pikina faŋ etempo mpiyeno neyii, mpiyeno Pútuun pa piteyii.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:11-12">Lewitik 26:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:27">Esekiyel 37:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 21:4" />Efiputoot mukun óo mukun ti ñíkinii. Eket etinene etaako niŋ keeŋoot, niŋ fotom pukooŋ niŋ ñíseeña, kaatuko waah wa weemaamane wa umuusaamuus.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 25:8">Esayi 25:8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 35:10">35:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 65:19">65:19</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 21:5" />Fiye, aŋa eeyeniye ya ti elemeyu ya naasok: “Nisincan, inci oopa ti íhinu waah wa púlooŋ upuyeno wéeyeeni.” Nene apenan apusok: “Kiic eehe, kaatuko kilim enke keehintiyee nkíyemi kiti páni.” <verse eid="REV 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 21:6" />Naasokam: “Fiye payaa! Inci yem Alfa ya niŋ Omega ya,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ti kaŋ ya eti Kilek, ti alfapet ya, leetal ya éyaañ ya eyem alfa, leetal ya ekelan ya eyem omega. Ta Yéesu naasoke ta nii: “Inci yem Alfa ya niŋ Omega ya”, ekina eyem: “Inci yem Ayáañ a niŋ Akelan a.”</char></note> Píyaañ pa niŋ Pikelan pa. Aŋa pálaani mpucoke, inci fawufanoo apilaan haahaw ti káapun ka kiti man ma miti eloŋ ya.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:1">Esayi 55:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 21:7" />An óo an eeheeke afaataak eehe púlooŋ, apan inci iyyeno Pútuun pa piteyoo, akina naayeno añiinam.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:14">2 Samiyel 7:14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:27-28">Kícimu 89:27-28</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 21:8" />Pale keewatata ka, kéeyinanut ka, píhina heenatee ha, pumukala pa, pusupoolata pa, pakasaay paka, pikaaya pa kaawaaseen ti pínaati niŋ ñincaama ña púlooŋ, efikayeno ti han ha hiti seemak sa séeceeke sa. Eehe hiyem eket ya ésupiyenu ya.”<verse eid="REV 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jerusalem éeyeeni ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 21:9" />Fiye, <char style="w">maleekoo</char> néekey ti inci. Ekina, ekee ti simaleekoo sa isak niŋ súsupak sa, seeyekane sa sipool sa isak niŋ súsupak sa seemeeŋe sa niŋ hítaapanu ha isak niŋ súsupak sa hikelan ha. Oom maleekoo néekey neesokam: “Kéy, inci fáyisani amaañoo ya, aal a ati Císaacii ca.” <verse eid="REV 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 21:10" /><char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> nkúwanoonii ti inci, nkucoopam ti tíntiŋ enfakat neehaan.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:2">Esekiyel 40:2</ref></char></note> Nkíyisanam <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>, saatee ya eesampanee ya, eeyeniye ya éfulii alacana pati Pútuun pa épuwanoonii. <verse eid="REV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 21:11" />Hamake ha hiti Pútuun pa nihicaaŋ teyyo. Saatee ya neemiñal, neecaaŋ cataŋ samat nii énankiin eti casup, ekina eyem énankiin éeciita hinoom neenakool nii weeloo. <verse eid="REV 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 21:12" />Hiniŋ ha héekinkoole ha saatee ya nihihaan, nihitaak kunkut kenfakat ŋaasuwan niŋ kúsupak, simaleekoo ŋaasuwan niŋ súsupak insifaas ko. Ucaw ŋaasuwan niŋ úsupak nuukiicee ti kunkut ka: ukina uyem ucaw wa uti písii pa ŋaasuwan niŋ pákasupak paka pakati <char style="w">Israyel</char>. <verse eid="REV 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 21:13" />Kaapii óo kaapii kiti hiniŋ ha nkitaak kunkut kíhaaciil: niŋ aasiiŋiyaa ti pututa saatee ya incoonool pa caanak ca íncifulii pa, intaak kunkut kíhaaciil hátikini, kíhaaciil pusoni, kíhaaciil ti epeesi yáali niŋ kíhaaciil ti epeesi yaamay.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:30-35">Esekiyel 40:30-35</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 21:14" />Hiniŋ ha hiti saatee ya nihisiiŋanee ti sínankiin senfakat ŋaasuwan niŋ súsupak, nkakiic tenso ucaw wa ŋaasuwan niŋ úsupak wa uti <char style="w" lemma="Apoñapoñ">pupoñapoñ</char> pa pakati Císaacii ca.<verse eid="REV 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 21:15" />Maleekoo ya eeyeniye ya káakup niŋ inci neeyekan hikasap hiti hiniiku hiti sanoo kati eniik saatee ya, kunkut ka, niŋ hiniŋ ha.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:3">Esekiyel 40:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 21:16" />Ta neeniike ta saatee ya, neecuk nii upii wa upaakiil wa púlooŋ ulehe pahaan. Pahaan eteyyo, paweñ eteyyo niŋ písik t’etaam fo patiila, pan óo pan intaak sikilomeetal síwuli súsupak niŋ sikeme súsupak (2,200).<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: “sikilomeetal síwuli súsupak niŋ sikeme sipaakiil (2,400).” Eeha <char style="w">Saŋ</char> naasoke ha le hiyem, sistad síwuli ŋaasuwan niŋ súsupak (12,000). Stad yoonool eyem máamun simeetal keme niŋ áwii epaakiil (180) ti cosaan ya eti Kilek ya.</char></note> <verse eid="REV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 21:17" />Neeniik hiniŋ ha, samat nii fa an naniik fa waah, pahaan pa mpitaak simeetal áwii éhaaciil niŋ isak (65).<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: “simeetal áwii éhaaciil (60).” Eeha Saŋ naasoke ha le hiyem, sikude keme niŋ áwii ésupak niŋ sipaakiil (144). Kude yoonool eyem máamun kancaŋ meetal.</char></note> <verse eid="REV 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 21:18" />Hiniŋ ha nihilutee niŋ pínankiin piti casup, saatee ya neelutee niŋ sanoo coopcoop, neekuul neecaaŋ samat nii weeloo. <verse eid="REV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 21:19" />Pínankiin empa hiniŋ ha hiti saatee ya nihilutee pa tempo mpúwalliyanee niŋ pukumpa óo pukumpa péeciita hinoom. Píyaañ pa mpusokee casup, púsupiyenu pa safiil, píhaaciyenu pa kalsetuwan, pípaakiilenu pa emelot, <verse eid="REV 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 21:20" />písakiyenu pa salutuwan, peewase pa isak niŋ yoonool kolunalin, isak niŋ súsupak kulusolit, isak niŋ síhaaciil pelil, isak niŋ sipaakiil topaas, ŋaasuwan kulsopalas, ŋaasuwan niŋ yoonool yasint, niŋ ŋaasuwan niŋ súsupak ametisut. <verse eid="REV 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 21:21" />Kunkut ka ŋaasuwan niŋ kúsupak ka nkíyemi pumaan penfakat piyema ŋaasuwan niŋ súsupak. Hunkut óo hunkut nihimemanoolee niŋ emaan yoonool. Pítin pa penfakat pa piti saatee ya sanoo coopcoop, mpukuul mpícaaŋinoolo samat nii weeloo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:11-12">Esayi 54:11-12</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 21:22" />Pale inci cukut ti saatee ya <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char>, kaatuko <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> Pútuun pa piti sempe sa púlooŋ niŋ Císaacii ca, poko kayem ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eteyyo. <verse eid="REV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 21:23" />Saatee ya esoolahut caanak ca niŋ fotom hiim ha kapicaaŋan yo, kamma hamake ha hiti Pútuun pa nihicaaŋan yo, Císaacii ca ciyem lampi eteyyo. <verse eid="REV 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 21:24" />Pakan paka púlooŋ efikamuumuusool ti pacaaŋ eteyyo, pumansa pa pakati etaam ya éfikacoopii hitaaku ha hiteyii teyyo. <verse eid="REV 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 21:25" />Kunkut ka kiti saatee ya etikipankee, kaatuko hánant etihitaako toko. <verse eid="REV 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 21:26" />Waah wa weewalla wa uti písii pa púlooŋ éfuucoopiyee toko niŋ hitaaku ha hiteyii. <verse eid="REV 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 21:27" />Waah weekuulut etuunako teyyo, niŋ fotom áhina heenatee niŋ fotom nincaama. Pale payenka ucawii weekiicee wa ti púkoo ya eti eloŋ ya eti Císaacii ca, poko lamma efikanako ti saatee ya.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:1">Esayi 52:1</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 60">60</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 44:9">Esekiyel 44:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 21:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="REV 22" />
  <para style="s">Hiyanu ha hiti eloŋ ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 22:1" />Fiye, <char style="w">maleekoo</char> ya néeyisanam hiyanu ha hiti man ma miti eloŋ ya. Immicaaŋ cataŋ samat nii weeloo, úmmufulii ti <char style="w">elemeyu</char> ya eti Pútuun pa niŋ Císaacii ca.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 47:1">Esekiyel 47:1</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 14:8">Sakaliya 14:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 22:2" />Ti pututa pítin pa penfakat pa piti saatee ya niŋ ti upii wa úsupak wa uti hiyanu ha, intaako punuun piti eloŋ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: “Man ma immitey ti pututa pítin pa piti saatee ya. Enuun ya eti eloŋ ya toko hiyanu ha níhikatinoolee. Oom enuun neepuk ñapukal ñiyema ŋaasuwan niŋ ñúsupak ti etiil ya. Hiim óo hiim neepuk poonool. Pahatal eteyyo mpúkuuñan písii pa púlooŋ.” </char></note><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:9-10">Púcook 2:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 47:12">Esekiyel 47:12</ref></char></note> Oom punuun mpupuk ñapukal ñiyema ŋaasuwan niŋ ñúsupak ti etiil ya. Hiim óo hiim mpupuk poonool. Pahatal etempo mpúkuuñan písii pa púlooŋ. <verse eid="REV 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 22:3" />Pañanal empa <char style="w">púlunta pa</char> mpiñanee pa etinene pitaako.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:17">Púcook 3:17</ref></char></note> Elemeyu ya eti Pútuun pa niŋ eti Císaacii ca efeeyeno ti saatee ya, pimiikan etempo nkawaaseen po. <verse eid="REV 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 22:4" />Efikacuk puhooŋu etempo, apan caacaw etempo incikiicee ti píyitii. <verse eid="REV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 22:5" />Etinene taak hánant. Etikasoolah ecaaŋ eti lampi niŋ fotom ecaaŋ eti caanak, kaatuko <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> Pútuun pa efipuwufanii ecaaŋ.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 60:19">Esayi 60:19</ref></char></note> Nkayeno pumansa fo cancowiyaaw púley.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:18">Dañel 7:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 22:6" />Fiye, maleekoo ya neesokam: “Kilim enke keehintiyee nkíyemi kiti páni. Ateeteyo Pútuun pa peewufane pa <char style="w" lemma="Ayaamakoola">piyaamakoola</char> pa <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char>, púpoñiyoopoñ maleekoo etempo épiyisan pimiikan etempo waah wa weekaakaay wa pitaako toko fiye.”<verse eid="REV 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ekéy ya eti Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 22:7" />Yéesu naasok: “Nísiitan, inci oopa ti ékey toko fiye! Ayihaayih éetuule ya kilim ka keeyaamakoolee ka kiti heekaakaay ha pitaako, keekiicee ka ti púkoo eyye!”<verse eid="REV 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 22:8" />Inci <char style="w">Saŋ</char>, inci síye incuk waah ewwe. Ta inci ínsiye ta incuk wo, ínkilipo ti woot <char style="w">maleekoo</char> ya eeyeniyaam ya káyisan wo, kati múl yo. <verse eid="REV 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 22:9" />Pale neesokam: “Ñaa, timpi hín eehuu! Inci lompo amiikan Pútuun samat nii awe niŋ pákawiyi <char style="w" lemma="Ayaamakoola">piyaamakoola</char> pa niŋ kéetuule ka hilim ha hiti púkoo eyye. Kílipo hátikin Pútuun pa!”<verse eid="REV 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 22:10" />Nene esokam: “Timpi yol kilim ka keeyaamakoolee ka keekiicee ka ti púkoo eyye, kaatuko caanak ca cílohaniyoo ta eehe púlooŋ efihitaako ta. <verse eid="REV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 22:11" />An óo an aŋa náhin heenaput, atowo ti íhinu heenaput; an óo an eekuulut, atowo ti káakuulaati; an óo an aŋa náhin <char style="w" lemma="Pucoonool">heecoonoole</char>, atowo ti íhinu heecoonoole; an óo an eekuule, atowo ti pakuul.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:10">Dañel 12:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 22:12" />Yéesu naasok: “Nísiitan, inci oopa ti ékey toko fiye! Inci fapuuñanool kéehine ka heenape, insiiŋan ti pisiya kéehine ka heenaput, inci facooy an óo an ti páhin pa piteyoo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 28:4">Kícimu 28:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 40:10">Esayi 40:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 62:11">62:11</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:10">Jeremiya 17:10</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="REV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 22:13" />Inci yem Alfa ya niŋ Omega ya, Ayáañ a niŋ Akelan a, Píyaañ pa niŋ Pikelan pa.”<verse eid="REV 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 22:14" />Kayihaayih keeñowe ka wañ wa uteyii, ancuk kati káyini hili papukal pa piti enuun ya eti eloŋ ya,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:9">Púcook 2:9</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 3:22">3:22</ref></char></note> nkanako ti putum saatee ya. <verse eid="REV 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 22:15" />Pale piyen pa, pakasaay paka, pusupoolata pa, pumukala pa, pikaaya pa kaawaaseen ti pínaati niŋ ñincaama ña kéelafiye ka kincaam, poko púlooŋ efikayeno tíkitaaŋ.<verse eid="REV 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 22:16" />“Inci Yéesu, póñiyoopoñ maleekoo ya etoom epusok aluu waah ewwe nípituunan wo picanku pa. Inci yem Hínkonk ha hiti miin ma miti amansa ya <char style="w">Dawid</char>,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:1">Esayi 11:1</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 11:10">10</ref></char></note> inci lompo yem Ecaaŋaŋ ya eemiñale ya eti mpucom pa.”<verse eid="REV 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 22:17" />
    <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> niŋ maañoo ya ati Císaacii ca nkasok: “Kéy!”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 22:17">An óo an éesiye, asok: “Kéy.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 22:17">An óo an aŋa pálaani mpucoke, ákey.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:1">Esayi 55:1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 22:17">An óo an éelafiye pálaani man ma miti eloŋ ya, alaan mo haahaw.<verse eid="REV 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 22:18" />Inci Saŋ, oopa ti kákupanan an óo an éesiye kilim ka keeyaamakoolee ka keekiicee ka ti púkoo eyye, kiti heekaakaay ha pitaako: an óo an eepenane tenko, Pútuun pa efipipenan teyoo hítaapanu óo hítaapanu heekiicee ti púkoo eyye. <verse eid="REV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 22:19" />An óo an éefulane hilim ti kilim ka kiti Pútuun pa keekiicee ka ti púkoo eyye, Pútuun pa éfipufulan himpaac ha hiteyoo ti enuun ya eti eloŋ ya niŋ ti saatee ya eesampanee ya, eekiicee ya ti púkoo eyye.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:2">Kakaman 4:2</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 13:1-5">13:1-5</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 22:20" />Yéesu éetuunane ya eehe, asok: “Ee, inci oopa ti ékey toko fiye!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:20">Amíini! Kéy, <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> Yéesu!<verse eid="REV 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 22:21" />Alímaati Ateeteyo Yéesu asampan aluu púlooŋ.<verse eid="REV 22:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 22" />
</usx>